Names_1xm1c_104"><span>Contributor: </span><span><a href="https://www.timeout.com/profile/christina-izzo">Christina Izzo</a></span></div></div></div></section></div></div><div data-testid="inline-generated-ad_testID" class="_inlineAdWrapper_16tbe_72 containerAdWrapper _inlineAdMobile_16tbe_151"><div class="_inlineAdContainer_16tbe_67"><span class="caps xs-block xs-text-10 xs-mb2 xs-text-center _inlineAdHeader_16tbe_82">Advertising</span><div class="_inlineAd_16tbe_67"><div id="ad-body-1-4975" class="_ad_16tbe_1 containerAd _ad-body_16tbe_165 _ad-mobile_16tbe_35" data-testid="ad_testID"><script>
                        window.rawSlots = window.rawSlots || [];
                        window.rawSlots.push('{"adSlotId":"/5185/body1/feature","adContainerId":"ad-body-1-4975","isOutOfPage":false,"isRegistered":false,"adSizes":[{"viewport":[992,50],"slotSize":[]},{"viewport":[320,50],"slotSize":[[1,1],[320,100],[320,50],[300,600],[300,250],[300,100],[300,50]]},{"viewport":[0,0],"slotSize":[]}],"prebidSizes":[{"minViewPort":[800,0],"sizes":[[728,90]]},{"minViewPort":[320,50],"sizes":[[320,100],[320,50],[300,600],[300,250],[300,100],[300,50]]},{"minViewPort":[320,0],"sizes":[[320,100],[320,50],[300,250],[300,100],[300,50]]},{"minViewPort":[0,0],"sizes":[]}],"adTags":[{"key":"type","value":"body1"},{"key":"ad_slot_number","value":"ad-body-1"}],"adSenseTags":[],"adSlotGroup":"body","breakpoints":["xs","sm"],"loadsAutomatically":true}');
                    </script></div></div></div></div><div id="content" class="_annotation_eevkt_71 _content_1dt80_1 contentAnnotation" data-component="annotation" data-testid="annotation_testID"><p>Looking for the best things to do in NYC this weekend? Whether you&rsquo;re the group planner searching for more things to do in NYC today or&nbsp;you&nbsp;have no&nbsp;plans yet,&nbsp;here are some&nbsp;ideas to add to your list for this weekend:&nbsp;including&nbsp;the Taste of Sunnyside food crawl through Queens, CultureCon, a weekly spooky movie watch party at a cocktail lounge and much more, plus&nbsp;<a href="https://www.timeout.com/newyork/things-to-do/free-things-to-do-in-nyc" target="_blank">free events around town</a>. All you have to do is scroll down to&nbsp;plan your weekend!</p>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<p><strong>And&nbsp;plan&nbsp;ahead for a great month with our round-up of the best things to do in <a href="https://www.timeout.com/newyork/events-calendar/october-events-calendar" target="_blank">October</a>.<span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<p><strong>RECOMMENDED: Full list of the <a href="https://www.timeout.com/newyork/things-to-do/101-things-to-do-in-new-york">best things to do in NYC<br /></a></strong><strong>RECOMMENDED: <a href="https://www.timeout.com/newyork/attractions/new-york-attractions">The best New York attractions</a></strong></p>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<p><strong>Stay in the Loop: Sign up for our<span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.timeout.com/newyork/newsletter?cid=nyc~editorial~acquisition~newsletter~contentlink" target="_blank">free weekly newsletter</a>&nbsp;to get<span>&nbsp;</span>the latest in New York City news, culture and dining.<span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p></div></div><div class="_landerNewsletter_eevkt_6 _hidden_eevkt_15"><div class="_container_1bbz3_1 newsletter_lander" data-component="inline-newsletter" data-newsletter-type="lander" data-testid="inline-newsletter_testID"><div class="row"><div class="panel_form"><div class="_section_heading_1bbz3_7"><p class="_form_title_1bbz3_32" data-lastword="friend.">Been there, done that? Think again, my <span>friend.</span></p><label class="_label_1bbz3_45">Sign up to our newsletter to enjoy New York without spending a thing (as well as options when you&#x27;re feeling flush).</label></div><form><div class="_section_form_1bbz3_11"><div class="_loading_overlay_1bbz3_52 loading_overlay"></div><div class="_zone_input_1bbz3_19"><label class="_text-hide_v9moj_1" for="lander-newsletter-email">Enter email address</label><input type="email" id="lander-newsletter-email" class="_email_1bbz3_89" placeholder="Enter email address" required="" data-private="lipsum"/><img class="_loading_icon_1bbz3_62 loading_icon" src="/static/images/loading_icon.gif" alt="Loading animation"/></div><div class="_zone_submit_1bbz3_26"><span class="_submitWrap_1bbz3_109"><input type="submit" class="_submit_1bbz3_109" value="Subscribe"/></span></div><div class="_errorMessage_1bbz3_72 error">Déjà vu! We already have this email. Try another?</div></div><div class="_disclaimer_1bbz3_154"><p>By entering your email address you agree to our <a href="https://www.timeout.com/terms-of-use" target="_blank">Terms of Use</a> and <a href="https://www.timeout.com/privacy-notice" target="_blank">Privacy Policy</a> and consent to receive emails from Time Out about news, events, offers and partner promotions.</p></div></form></div><div class="_panel_success_1bbz3_185 panel_success"><p class="_success_title_1bbz3_189">🙌<br/>Awesome, you&#x27;re subscribed!</p><p class="_success_thanks_1bbz3_198">Thanks for subscribing! Look out for your first newsletter in your inbox soon!</p></div></div></div></div><div data-component="interscroller"></div><div data-zone-name="TO_Market_zero_zone" class="zone _zoneFirst_367pt_5 _zone_367pt_1" data-testid="zone-zero_testID"><div class="_content_7l205_1"><div class="_logo_7l205_30"><img src="/static/images/tom/tom_logo_neg_us-newyork.png" alt="Time Out Market New York"/></div><div class="_zoneItems_7l205_5 zoneItems"><article class="tile _article_l7w5l_1" data-testid="tile-zone-zero_testID"><div class="articleContent _articleContent_l7w5l_1"><div class="_title_l7w5l_18"><div class="" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><h3 class="_h3_c6c0h_1" data-testid="tile-title_testID">Time Out Market New York</h3></div></div><div class="_imageContainer_l7w5l_113"><div class="" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><div class="_imageWrap_l7w5l_119"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106324034/380/285/image.webp 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106324034/750/562/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106324034/1024/768/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106324034/1372/1029/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106324034/1536/1152/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106324034/1920/1440/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="562"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106324034/750/562/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106324034/380/285/image.jpg 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106324034/750/562/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106324034/1024/768/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106324034/1372/1029/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106324034/1536/1152/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106324034/1920/1440/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="aspect-ratio-4-3" title="Time Out Market New York" alt="Time Out Market New York" width="750" height="562" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="_imageCreditWrap_l7w5l_137"><figcaption class="_figcaption_18vpl_1" data-testid="image-credits_testID"><span>Photograph: Courtesy of Noah Fecks</span></figcaption></div></div></div><div class="_summaryContainer_l7w5l_30"><div class="_summary_l7w5l_30"><div class="_p_1mmxl_1" data-testid="summary_testID"><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Time Out Market had one mission when it arrived in New York in 2019: to find the best restaurants and bar talents and gather them all under one roof. We did pretty well with the opening of</span><a href="https://www.timeout.com/time-out-market-new-york"> <span style="font-weight: 400;">Time Out Market New York, Brooklyn</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">, as the two-story building right on the edge of the Dumbo waterfront packs a curated selection of 19 eateries, three bars and a fifth-floor rooftop that easily gives one of the best views of the skyline beyond. </span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The newly minted Manhattan sister,&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.timeout.com/time-out-market-union-square"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Time Out Market New York, Union Square</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">, follows in its footsteps, as the neighborhood model features seven food vendors, a full-service bar and a backyard patio for eating and imbibing.&nbsp;</span></p></div></div></div></div></article></div></div></div><div data-zone-name="large_list" class="zone _zone_367pt_1 _container_1t43t_1" data-component="lazy-load-zone" data-params="{&quot;zoneId&quot;:&quot;1453951&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;/30/en-US/pages/35475/zone/1453951?site_id=us-newyork&amp;pageNumber=:pageNumber&amp;pageSize=101&amp;gp-web=true&quot;}" data-testid="zone-large-list_testID"><h2 class="_h2_1nkur_1" data-testid="zone-title_testID"><span>Things to do in NYC this weekend</span></h2><div class="_zoneItems_1t43t_5 zoneItems"><article class="tile _article_a9slj_1" data-testid="tile-zone-large-list_testID"><div class="articleContent _articleContent_a9slj_226"><div class="_title_a9slj_11"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/taste-of-sunnyside" class="" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><h3 class="_h3_c6c0h_1" data-testid="tile-title_testID"><span>1.</span>&nbsp;Taste of Sunnyside</h3></a></div><div class="_tileTags_a9slj_52"><section class="_tags_1i2cm_17" data-testid="tags_testID"><ul class="_tagsList_1i2cm_17"><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Things to do</span></li></ul></section></div><div class="_imageContainer_a9slj_48"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/taste-of-sunnyside" class="tileImageLink" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapDesktop_a9slj_100"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/105938282/400/225/image.webp 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105938282/750/422/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105938282/1024/576/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105938282/1372/772/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105938282/1536/864/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105938282/1920/1080/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="422"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/105938282/750/422/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/105938282/400/225/image.jpg 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105938282/750/422/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105938282/1024/576/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105938282/1372/772/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105938282/1536/864/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105938282/1920/1080/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-16-9" title="Taste of Sunnyside" alt="Taste of Sunnyside" width="750" height="422" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapMobile_a9slj_205"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/105938282/380/285/image.webp 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105938282/750/562/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105938282/1024/768/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105938282/1372/1029/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105938282/1536/1152/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105938282/1920/1440/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="562"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/105938282/750/562/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/105938282/380/285/image.jpg 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105938282/750/562/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105938282/1024/768/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105938282/1372/1029/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105938282/1536/1152/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105938282/1920/1440/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-4-3" title="Taste of Sunnyside" alt="Taste of Sunnyside" width="750" height="562" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><figcaption class="_figcaption_18vpl_1" data-testid="image-credits_testID"><span>Photograph: Courtesy of Taste of Sunnyside</span></figcaption></a></div><div class="_summaryContainer_a9slj_361"><div class="_summary_a9slj_23"><div class="_p_1mmxl_1" data-testid="summary_testID"><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="uuid" content="uuiduxsLUSDdl3PR" />
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Sunnyside Queens' edible offerings get the attention they deserve at this casual tasting affair.&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><a class="editor-rtfLink" href="https://sunnysideshines.org/events/taste-of-sunnyside-2026/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Taste of Sunnyside</span></a><span data-preserver-spaces="true">&nbsp;returns for a sixteenth year on Sunday, October 4. From&nbsp;1 to </span><span data-preserver-spaces="true">7pm</span><span data-preserver-spaces="true">,&nbsp;more than 60 restaurants will participate in the door-to-door crawl, showcasing the best of the neighborhood. This annual food&nbsp;feat offers a taste of Latin, Italian, French, Asian </span><span data-preserver-spaces="true">and</span><span data-preserver-spaces="true"> Middle Eastern cuisines, including&nbsp;Cardamom,&nbsp;de Mole Mexican Restaurant&nbsp;</span><span data-preserver-spaces="true">and</span><span data-preserver-spaces="true"> Masa Madre. The lineup also includes plenty of bars and breweries, perfect for a build-your-own bar crawl itinerary. Don't feel like walking the whole way? Participants can hop </span><span data-preserver-spaces="true">and</span><span data-preserver-spaces="true"> off the complimentary event trolley.&nbsp;And when you need a grub break, head to the real party going down&nbsp;on 46th Street under the Sunnyside Arch (between Queens Boulevard and Greenpoint Avenue). Pop by for live entertainment, a local arts fair </span><span data-preserver-spaces="true">and</span><span data-preserver-spaces="true">&nbsp;loads of family-friendly activities.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Tickets are $58.44, inclusive of fees. There is a special kids rate for children aged 6-12; ages five and under are free. Register&nbsp;</span><a class="editor-rtfLink" href="https://events.humanitix.com/tos_restaurant-crawl-2026" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">here</span></a><span data-preserver-spaces="true">.&nbsp;</span></p>
</div></div></div><div class="_ctaButtons_a9slj_109"><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _viewMoreCta_a9slj_130"><a class="_secondary_1gagn_22" href="/newyork/things-to-do/taste-of-sunnyside" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;read more button&quot;}}" data-testid="view-more-cta_testID"><span class="_textContent_1gagn_69">Read more</span></a></div><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _bookingCta_a9slj_131"><a class="_a_1fa6w_1" href="https://events.humanitix.com/tos_restaurant-crawl-2026" data-testid="buy-now-button_testID" target="_blank" rel="nofollow" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;label&quot;:&quot;ev booking&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;affiliate_partner&quot;:&quot;other&quot;,&quot;affiliate_link_type&quot;:&quot;button&quot;,&quot;affiliate_link_location&quot;:&quot;list&quot;,&quot;affiliate_superlist_position&quot;:1}}">Buy ticket</a></div></div></div></article><article class="tile _article_a9slj_1" data-testid="tile-zone-large-list_testID"><div class="articleContent _articleContent_a9slj_226"><div class="_title_a9slj_11"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/culturecon" class="" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><h3 class="_h3_c6c0h_1" data-testid="tile-title_testID"><span>2.</span>&nbsp;CultureCon</h3></a></div><div class="_tileTags_a9slj_52"><section class="_tags_1i2cm_17" data-testid="tags_testID"><ul class="_tagsList_1i2cm_17"><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Things to do</span></li></ul></section></div><div class="_imageContainer_a9slj_48"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/culturecon" class="tileImageLink" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapDesktop_a9slj_100"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106323429/400/225/image.webp 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106323429/750/422/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106323429/1024/576/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106323429/1372/772/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106323429/1536/864/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106323429/1920/1080/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="422"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106323429/750/422/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106323429/400/225/image.jpg 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106323429/750/422/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106323429/1024/576/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106323429/1372/772/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106323429/1536/864/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106323429/1920/1080/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-16-9" title="CultureCon" alt="CultureCon" width="750" height="422" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapMobile_a9slj_205"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106323429/380/285/image.webp 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106323429/750/562/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106323429/1024/768/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106323429/1372/1029/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106323429/1536/1152/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106323429/1920/1440/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="562"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106323429/750/562/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106323429/380/285/image.jpg 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106323429/750/562/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106323429/1024/768/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106323429/1372/1029/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106323429/1536/1152/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106323429/1920/1440/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-4-3" title="CultureCon" alt="CultureCon" width="750" height="562" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><figcaption class="_figcaption_18vpl_1" data-testid="image-credits_testID"><span>Photograph: By Shane Miller @sirshanephoto</span></figcaption></a></div><div class="_summaryContainer_a9slj_361"><div class="_summary_a9slj_23"><div class="_p_1mmxl_1" data-testid="summary_testID"><meta charset="utf-8" />
<p>CultureCon&nbsp;transorms Brooklyn's Duggal Greenhouse from an industrial shipyard into a cultural homecoming for Black creatives. It welcomes more than 10,000 attendees across two days to&nbsp;hear from&nbsp;more than&nbsp;200 speakers, participate in hands-on workshops, attend a career fair&nbsp;and check out immersive activations. Event organizers call it "t<span>he nation's leading gathering for creatives of color."</span></p>
<p>This year's speakers&nbsp;are still to be announced, but&nbsp;the theme for 2026 is "Museum&nbsp;of Us," celebrates Black creativity as the art it has always been.</p>
<p>This year's event is on October 3&nbsp;and 4; attendees must be 18 or older.&nbsp;Single-day admission tickets cost<span>&nbsp;</span><span>$129</span>, and weekend tickets cost $239. VIP tickets cost $649. Discounts are available for students and those who sign up in groups. Digital passes (for those who can't make it in person) are available for $19. The festival is part of CultureCon Week, which runs September 28&ndash;October 1, followed by a kickoff party October 2.</p></div></div></div><div class="_ctaButtons_a9slj_109"><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _viewMoreCta_a9slj_130"><a class="_secondary_1gagn_22" href="/newyork/things-to-do/culturecon" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;read more button&quot;}}" data-testid="view-more-cta_testID"><span class="_textContent_1gagn_69">Read more</span></a></div><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _bookingCta_a9slj_131"><a class="_a_1fa6w_1" href="https://cultureconcollective.com/culturecon-2026-festival#cc-fest-tickets" data-testid="buy-now-button_testID" target="_blank" rel="nofollow" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;label&quot;:&quot;ev booking&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;affiliate_partner&quot;:&quot;other&quot;,&quot;affiliate_link_type&quot;:&quot;button&quot;,&quot;affiliate_link_location&quot;:&quot;list&quot;,&quot;affiliate_superlist_position&quot;:2}}">Buy ticket</a></div></div></div></article><div class="_adsInline_1t43t_10"><div data-testid="inline-generated-ad_testID" class="_inlineAdWrapper_16tbe_72 containerAdWrapper"><div class="_inlineAdContainer_16tbe_67"><span class="caps xs-block xs-text-10 xs-mb2 xs-text-center _inlineAdHeader_16tbe_82">Advertising</span><div class="_inlineAd_16tbe_67"><div id="ad-list-1-8382" class="_ad_16tbe_1 containerAd _ad-list_16tbe_61 " data-testid="ad_testI