                    </script></div></div></div></div></div><article class="tile _article_a9slj_1" data-testid="tile-zone-large-list_testID"><div class="articleContent _articleContent_a9slj_226"><div class="_title_a9slj_11"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/freaky-movie-fridays-at-foxtail" class="" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><h3 class="_h3_c6c0h_1" data-testid="tile-title_testID"><span>5.</span>&nbsp;Freaky Movie Fridays at Foxtail</h3></a></div><div class="_tileTags_a9slj_52"><section class="_tags_1i2cm_17" data-testid="tags_testID"><ul class="_tagsList_1i2cm_17"><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Things to do</span></li></ul></section></div><div class="_imageContainer_a9slj_48"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/freaky-movie-fridays-at-foxtail" class="tileImageLink" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapDesktop_a9slj_100"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106450207/400/225/image.webp 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106450207/750/422/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106450207/1024/576/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106450207/1372/772/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106450207/1536/864/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106450207/1920/1080/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="422"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106450207/750/422/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106450207/400/225/image.jpg 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106450207/750/422/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106450207/1024/576/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106450207/1372/772/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106450207/1536/864/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106450207/1920/1080/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-16-9" title="Freaky Movie Fridays at Foxtail" alt="Freaky Movie Fridays at Foxtail" width="750" height="422" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapMobile_a9slj_205"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106450207/380/285/image.webp 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106450207/750/562/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106450207/1024/768/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106450207/1372/1029/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106450207/1536/1152/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106450207/1920/1440/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="562"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106450207/750/562/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106450207/380/285/image.jpg 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106450207/750/562/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106450207/1024/768/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106450207/1372/1029/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106450207/1536/1152/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106450207/1920/1440/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-4-3" title="Freaky Movie Fridays at Foxtail" alt="Freaky Movie Fridays at Foxtail" width="750" height="562" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><figcaption class="_figcaption_18vpl_1" data-testid="image-credits_testID"><span>Courtesy of Nicholas Lee Ruiz</span></figcaption></a></div><div class="_summaryContainer_a9slj_361"><div class="_summary_a9slj_23"><div class="_p_1mmxl_1" data-testid="summary_testID"><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta charset="utf-8" />
<p><span>Every Friday in October from&nbsp;7 to 10pm, intimate cocktail den Foxtail (231 Hudson St.) will feel a little more seasonal.&nbsp;The lounge is&nbsp;hosting a Spooky Movie Month&nbsp;series in the Living Room at Arlo SoHo, where guests will settle in for an evening of horror classics&nbsp;and themed, discounted, film-inspired menu specials. For those who love a combo meal,&nbsp;there's a&nbsp;</span><span>$19 "spooky deal"&nbsp;that includes&nbsp;a sandwich, chips and a cookie.</span><span>&nbsp;No ticket is needed, but there is a two-item minimum per attendee. Seating is first-come, first-served, so get there early to claim your spot. The film lineup consists of T</span><em>he Lost Boys</em><span>&nbsp;(Oct. 2),&nbsp;</span><em>Donnie Darko</em><span>&nbsp;(Oct. 9),&nbsp;</span><em>Hereditary</em><span>&nbsp;(Oct. 16),&nbsp;</span><em>The Craft</em><span>&nbsp;(Oct. 23) and&nbsp;</span><em>The Shining</em><span>&nbsp;(Oct. 30).</span></p></div></div></div><div class="_ctaButtons_a9slj_109"><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _viewMoreCta_a9slj_130"><a class="_secondary_1gagn_22" href="/newyork/things-to-do/freaky-movie-fridays-at-foxtail" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;read more button&quot;}}" data-testid="view-more-cta_testID"><span class="_textContent_1gagn_69">Read more</span></a></div></div></div></article><article class="tile _article_a9slj_1" data-testid="tile-zone-large-list_testID"><div class="articleContent _articleContent_a9slj_226"><div class="_title_a9slj_11"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/nyc-yarn-crawl" class="" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><h3 class="_h3_c6c0h_1" data-testid="tile-title_testID"><span>6.</span>&nbsp;NYC Yarn Crawl</h3></a></div><div class="_tileTags_a9slj_52"><section class="_tags_1i2cm_17" data-testid="tags_testID"><ul class="_tagsList_1i2cm_17"><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Things to do</span></li><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Games and hobbies</span></li></ul></section></div><div class="_imageContainer_a9slj_48"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/nyc-yarn-crawl" class="tileImageLink" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapDesktop_a9slj_100"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106452122/400/225/image.webp 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106452122/750/422/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106452122/1024/576/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106452122/1372/772/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106452122/1536/864/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106452122/1920/1080/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="422"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106452122/750/422/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106452122/400/225/image.jpg 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106452122/750/422/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106452122/1024/576/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106452122/1372/772/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106452122/1536/864/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106452122/1920/1080/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-16-9" title="NYC Yarn Crawl" alt="NYC Yarn Crawl" width="750" height="422" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapMobile_a9slj_205"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106452122/380/285/image.webp 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106452122/750/562/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106452122/1024/768/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106452122/1372/1029/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106452122/1536/1152/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106452122/1920/1440/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="562"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106452122/750/562/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106452122/380/285/image.jpg 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106452122/750/562/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106452122/1024/768/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106452122/1372/1029/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106452122/1536/1152/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106452122/1920/1440/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-4-3" title="NYC Yarn Crawl" alt="NYC Yarn Crawl" width="750" height="562" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><figcaption class="_figcaption_18vpl_1" data-testid="image-credits_testID"><span>Photograph: Kristen Couchot</span></figcaption></a></div><div class="_summaryContainer_a9slj_361"><div class="_summary_a9slj_23"><div class="_p_1mmxl_1" data-testid="summary_testID"><meta charset="utf-8" />
<p><span>Go batty for yarn at the 18th annual NYC Yarn Crawl, a free, family-friendly celebration of New York&rsquo;s knitting and fiber-art community. From October 1 through 4,&nbsp;</span><span>knit and purl</span><span> your way through 13 independent yarn shops across Manhattan, Brooklyn and Queens for exclusive yarns, discounts, pop-ups, trunk shows and workshops. You'll plot your own route using the map of participants provided both as a PDF&nbsp;and on Google Maps&mdash;knitter's choice! Highlights include Knitty City&rsquo;s 20th-anniversary custom yarns, a free make-your-own-yarn bar at Whirlwind Yarns, free workshops at Cleo&rsquo;s Craft Cafe and Brooklyn Craft Company, and plenty of&nbsp;crafty&nbsp;surprises. Crawlers can&nbsp;s</span>ign in at each store to be entered into prize drawings, including the&nbsp;Scavenger Hunt Grand Prize Raffle, for which you'll have to&nbsp;search for a specific&nbsp;item in each&nbsp;shop. Winners will be announced in the days following the crawl.</p>
<p><span>This year&rsquo;s crawl also supports Bat Conservation International, with donations collected at participating shops. Check the event website for participating locations and schedules.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="_ctaButtons_a9slj_109"><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _viewMoreCta_a9slj_130"><a class="_secondary_1gagn_22" href="/newyork/things-to-do/nyc-yarn-crawl" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;read more button&quot;}}" data-testid="view-more-cta_testID"><span class="_textContent_1gagn_69">Read more</span></a></div></div></div></article><div class="_adsInline_1t43t_10"><div data-testid="inline-generated-ad_testID" class="_inlineAdWrapper_16tbe_72 containerAdWrapper"><div class="_inlineAdContainer_16tbe_67"><span class="caps xs-block xs-text-10 xs-mb2 xs-text-center _inlineAdHeader_16tbe_82">Advertising</span><div class="_inlineAd_16tbe_67"><div id="ad-list-3-8102" class="_ad_16tbe_1 containerAd _ad-list_16tbe_61 " data-testid="ad_testID"><script>
