                    </script></div></div></div></div></div><article class="tile _article_a9slj_1" data-testid="tile-zone-large-list_testID"><div class="articleContent _articleContent_a9slj_226"><div class="_title_a9slj_11"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/blood-manor" class="" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><h3 class="_h3_c6c0h_1" data-testid="tile-title_testID"><span>7.</span>&nbsp;BloodManor</h3></a></div><div class="_tileTags_a9slj_52"><section class="_tags_1i2cm_17" data-testid="tags_testID"><ul class="_tagsList_1i2cm_17"><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Things to do</span></li><li class="_tagBare_1i2cm_27 _tagComponent_1i2cm_63"><div class="_container_12ex6_1" data-testid="recommended_testID"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="_svg_12ex6_10"><path d="M20 6L9 17L4 12" stroke="#e1192c" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="_title_12ex6_24">Recommended</span></div></li></ul></section></div><div class="_imageContainer_a9slj_48"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/blood-manor" class="tileImageLink" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapDesktop_a9slj_100"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106311282/400/225/image.webp 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106311282/750/422/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106311282/1024/576/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106311282/1372/772/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106311282/1536/864/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106311282/1920/1080/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="422"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106311282/750/422/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106311282/400/225/image.jpg 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106311282/750/422/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106311282/1024/576/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106311282/1372/772/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106311282/1536/864/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106311282/1920/1080/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-16-9" title="BloodManor" alt="BloodManor" width="750" height="422" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapMobile_a9slj_205"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106311282/380/285/image.webp 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106311282/750/562/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106311282/1024/768/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106311282/1372/1029/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106311282/1536/1152/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106311282/1920/1440/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="562"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106311282/750/562/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106311282/380/285/image.jpg 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106311282/750/562/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106311282/1024/768/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106311282/1372/1029/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106311282/1536/1152/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106311282/1920/1440/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-4-3" title="BloodManor" alt="BloodManor" width="750" height="562" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><figcaption class="_figcaption_18vpl_1" data-testid="image-credits_testID"><span>Photograph: Courtesy of BloodManor</span></figcaption></a></div><div class="_summaryContainer_a9slj_361"><div class="_summary_a9slj_23"><div class="_p_1mmxl_1" data-testid="summary_testID"><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta charset="utf-8" />
<p>There&rsquo;s no spookier way to welcome the Halloween season than to visit BloodManor, the popular 10,000-square-foot haunted house that&rsquo;s actually deemed too scary for children under 14.</p>
<p>Visitors will confront their deepest fears as they journey through dark, sinister corridors filled with twisted characters and scares at every turn. Incorporating state-of-the-art special effects, BloodManor brings unparalleled realism to the haunting experience thanks to a terrifyingly talented team of trained actors, set designers, makeup artists and more. Expect an&nbsp;<span style="font-weight: 400;">unprecedented</span><span>&nbsp;level of horror and excitement that lasts 30 minutes&mdash;or, more likely, 20 minutes as you run screaming</span>.&nbsp;</p>
<p>BloodManor is open every weekend and some weekdays&nbsp;from October 2 to&nbsp;November 7 at&nbsp;359 Broadway in downtown Manhattan. General admission starts at $50 per ticket. You can purchase tickets for a timed entry<span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.bloodmanor.com/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer">here</a>.</p></div></div></div><div class="_ctaButtons_a9slj_109"><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _viewMoreCta_a9slj_130"><a class="_secondary_1gagn_22" href="/newyork/things-to-do/blood-manor" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;read more button&quot;}}" data-testid="view-more-cta_testID"><span class="_textContent_1gagn_69">Read more</span></a></div><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _bookingCta_a9slj_131"><a class="_a_1fa6w_1" href="https://www.bloodmanor.com/" data-testid="buy-now-button_testID" target="_blank" rel="nofollow" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;label&quot;:&quot;ev booking&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;affiliate_partner&quot;:&quot;other&quot;,&quot;affiliate_link_type&quot;:&quot;button&quot;,&quot;affiliate_link_location&quot;:&quot;list&quot;,&quot;affiliate_superlist_position&quot;:7}}">Buy ticket</a></div></div></div></article><article class="tile _article_a9slj_1" data-testid="tile-zone-large-list_testID"><div class="articleContent _articleContent_a9slj_226"><div class="_title_a9slj_11"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/classic-harbor-line-fall-foliage-tours" class="" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><h3 class="_h3_c6c0h_1" data-testid="tile-title_testID"><span>8.</span>&nbsp;Classic Harbor Line Fall Foliage Tours</h3></a></div><div class="_tileTags_a9slj_52"><section class="_tags_1i2cm_17" data-testid="tags_testID"><ul class="_tagsList_1i2cm_17"><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Things to do</span></li></ul></section></div><div class="_imageContainer_a9slj_48"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/classic-harbor-line-fall-foliage-tours" class="tileImageLink" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapDesktop_a9slj_100"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106438626/400/225/image.webp 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106438626/750/422/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106438626/1024/576/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106438626/1372/772/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106438626/1536/864/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106438626/1920/1080/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="422"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106438626/750/422/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106438626/400/225/image.jpg 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106438626/750/422/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106438626/1024/576/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106438626/1372/772/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106438626/1536/864/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106438626/1920/1080/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-16-9" title="Classic Harbor Line Fall Foliage Tours" alt="Classic Harbor Line Fall Foliage Tours" width="750" height="422" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapMobile_a9slj_205"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106438626/380/285/image.webp 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106438626/750/562/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106438626/1024/768/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106438626/1372/1029/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106438626/1536/1152/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106438626/1920/1440/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="562"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106438626/750/562/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106438626/380/285/image.jpg 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106438626/750/562/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106438626/1024/768/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106438626/1372/1029/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106438626/1536/1152/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106438626/1920/1440/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-4-3" title="Classic Harbor Line Fall Foliage Tours" alt="Classic Harbor Line Fall Foliage Tours" width="750" height="562" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><figcaption class="_figcaption_18vpl_1" data-testid="image-credits_testID"><span>Photograph: Courtesy Classic Harbor Line</span></figcaption></a></div><div class="_summaryContainer_a9slj_361"><div class="_summary_a9slj_23"><div class="_p_1mmxl_1" data-testid="summary_testID"><meta charset="utf-8" />
<p style="font-weight: 400;">Want to get out of the city this fall? You're in luck: Classic Harbor Line&nbsp;offers scenic fall foliage sails aboard gorgeous vintage vessels with&nbsp;a front-row seat to the changing of the seasons stretching from the&nbsp;Hudson River to the Palisades. Cruises run&nbsp;multiple times a week<span>&nbsp;</span>from October 3 through November 15.</p>
<p>Enjoy the&nbsp;chance to admire spectacular&nbsp;fall foliage&nbsp;by boat. Plus, these elegant 1920s-style yachts make the experience extra special. In addition to gawking at the leaves, you'll get to see&nbsp;iconic and<span>&nbsp;</span>picturesque landmarks such as the George Washington Bridge,<span>&nbsp;</span>The Met Cloisters, the Palisades and the Little Red Lighthouse.</p>
<p>Plus, Classic Harbor Line offers&nbsp;several more unique options,&nbsp;including the Fall Foliage Brunch Cruises on Saturday and Sunday mornings and an Urban Naturalist-narrated tour with expert commentary on the fascinating geology of the Palisades and the Hudson River. There's also the&nbsp;Grand Palisades Fall Foliage Schooner Sail if you're looking to travel largely by wind, with more time to contemplate the beautiful surroundings. Every ticket includes a complimentary beverage.</p></div></div></div><div class="_ctaButtons_a9slj_109"><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _viewMoreCta_a9slj_130"><a class="_secondary_1gagn_22" href="/newyork/things-to-do/classic-harbor-line-fall-foliage-tours" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;read more button&quot;}}" data-testid="view-more-cta_testID"><span class="_textContent_1gagn_69">Read more</span></a></div></div></div></article><div class="_adsInline_1t43t_10"><div data-testid="inline-generated-ad_testID" class="_inlineAdWrapper_16tbe_72 containerAdWrapper"><div class="_inlineAdContainer_16tbe_67"><span class="caps xs-block xs-text-10 xs-mb2 xs-text-center _inlineAdHeader_16tbe_82">Advertising</span><div class="_inlineAd_16tbe_67"><div id="ad-list-4-4894" class="_ad_16tbe_1 containerAd _ad-list_16tbe_61 " data-testid="ad_testID"><script>
