                    </script></div></div></div></div></div><article class="tile _article_a9slj_1" data-testid="tile-zone-large-list_testID"><div class="articleContent _articleContent_a9slj_226"><div class="_title_a9slj_11"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/the-infinite-table" class="" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><h3 class="_h3_c6c0h_1" data-testid="tile-title_testID"><span>9.</span>&nbsp;The Infinite Table</h3></a></div><div class="_tileTags_a9slj_52"><section class="_tags_1i2cm_17" data-testid="tags_testID"><ul class="_tagsList_1i2cm_17"><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Things to do</span></li></ul></section></div><div class="_imageContainer_a9slj_48"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/the-infinite-table" class="tileImageLink" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapDesktop_a9slj_100"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106448980/400/225/image.webp 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448980/750/422/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448980/1024/576/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448980/1372/772/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448980/1536/864/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448980/1920/1080/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="422"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106448980/750/422/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106448980/400/225/image.jpg 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448980/750/422/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448980/1024/576/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448980/1372/772/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448980/1536/864/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448980/1920/1080/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-16-9" title="The Infinite Table" alt="The Infinite Table" width="750" height="422" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapMobile_a9slj_205"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106448980/380/285/image.webp 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448980/750/562/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448980/1024/768/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448980/1372/1029/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448980/1536/1152/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448980/1920/1440/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="562"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106448980/750/562/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106448980/380/285/image.jpg 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448980/750/562/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448980/1024/768/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448980/1372/1029/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448980/1536/1152/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448980/1920/1440/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-4-3" title="The Infinite Table" alt="The Infinite Table" width="750" height="562" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><figcaption class="_figcaption_18vpl_1" data-testid="image-credits_testID"><span>Photograph: Oveck Reyes</span></figcaption></a></div><div class="_summaryContainer_a9slj_361"><div class="_summary_a9slj_23"><div class="_p_1mmxl_1" data-testid="summary_testID"><p>When they say dinner is a journey, they usually don't mean it quite as literally as at The Infinite Table, an immersive dining experience combining a multi-course meal with 360-degree projection, sound and scent. Its latest experience, Oaxaca: Tierra y Tiempo, transports diners through the landscapes, traditions and flavors of Oaxaca, Mexico, with the room transforming alongside each course. The experience includes a three-course lunch or five-course dinner, with both standard and vegan menus available. Seatings take place at communal tables, making the meal as much about meeting fellow diners as exploring another culture. The Infinite Table holds four seatings (noon, 2pm, 5:30pm, 8pm) each day at ARTXNYC (409 W. 14th St.) Fridays, Saturdays, and Sundays from October 2 through 25.</p></div></div></div><div class="_ctaButtons_a9slj_109"><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _viewMoreCta_a9slj_130"><a class="_secondary_1gagn_22" href="/newyork/things-to-do/the-infinite-table" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;read more button&quot;}}" data-testid="view-more-cta_testID"><span class="_textContent_1gagn_69">Read more</span></a></div></div></div></article><article class="tile _article_a9slj_1" data-testid="tile-zone-large-list_testID"><div class="articleContent _articleContent_a9slj_226"><div class="_title_a9slj_11"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/the-weight-of-normal-things" class="" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><h3 class="_h3_c6c0h_1" data-testid="tile-title_testID"><span>10.</span>&nbsp;The Weight of Normal Things</h3></a></div><div class="_tileTags_a9slj_52"><section class="_tags_1i2cm_17" data-testid="tags_testID"><ul class="_tagsList_1i2cm_17"><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Things to do</span></li><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Exhibitions</span></li></ul></section></div><div class="_imageContainer_a9slj_48"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/the-weight-of-normal-things" class="tileImageLink" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapDesktop_a9slj_100"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106448484/400/225/image.webp 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448484/750/422/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448484/1024/576/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448484/1372/772/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448484/1536/864/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448484/1920/1080/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="422"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106448484/750/422/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106448484/400/225/image.jpg 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448484/750/422/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448484/1024/576/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448484/1372/772/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448484/1536/864/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448484/1920/1080/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-16-9" title="The Weight of Normal Things" alt="The Weight of Normal Things" width="750" height="422" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapMobile_a9slj_205"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106448484/380/285/image.webp 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448484/750/562/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448484/1024/768/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448484/1372/1029/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448484/1536/1152/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448484/1920/1440/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="562"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106448484/750/562/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106448484/380/285/image.jpg 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448484/750/562/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448484/1024/768/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448484/1372/1029/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448484/1536/1152/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448484/1920/1440/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-4-3" title="The Weight of Normal Things" alt="The Weight of Normal Things" width="750" height="562" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><figcaption class="_figcaption_18vpl_1" data-testid="image-credits_testID"><span>Photograph: Courtesy Patrick-Earl Barnes</span></figcaption></a></div><div class="_summaryContainer_a9slj_361"><div class="_summary_a9slj_23"><div class="_p_1mmxl_1" data-testid="summary_testID"><meta charset="utf-8" />
<p><span>Sofy Gallery in Chelsea opens a new group exhibit,&nbsp;</span><em>The Weight of Normal Things,</em><span>&nbsp;on October 1,&nbsp;joining&nbsp;painters Susan P. Martin and Patrick Earl Barnes with photographer Mara Clemente for a meditation on beauty hiding in plain sight. Curated by Luca Cantore D&rsquo;Amore, the exhibition considers everyday people, places and gestures through three distinct forms of attention. Martin&rsquo;s paintings blur self-portraiture and landscape, Barnes shows quietly charged urban scenes and Clemente's photographs bring the intimacy. The show kicks off the gallery&rsquo;s 2026/'27 season and runs through October 24. Admission is free, with an opening reception from 6&nbsp;to 9pm on October 1.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="_ctaButtons_a9slj_109"><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _viewMoreCta_a9slj_130"><a class="_secondary_1gagn_22" href="/newyork/things-to-do/the-weight-of-normal-things" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;read more button&quot;}}" data-testid="view-more-cta_testID"><span class="_textContent_1gagn_69">Read more</span></a></div></div></div></article><div class="_adsInline_1t43t_10"><div data-testid="inline-generated-ad_testID" class="_inlineAdWrapper_16tbe_72 containerAdWrapper"><div class="_inlineAdContainer_16tbe_67"><span class="caps xs-block xs-text-10 xs-mb2 xs-text-center _inlineAdHeader_16tbe_82">Advertising</span><div class="_inlineAd_16tbe_67"><div id="ad-list-5-9787" class="_ad_16tbe_1 containerAd _ad-list_16tbe_61 " data-testid="ad_testID"><script>
