                    </script></div></div></div></div></div><article class="tile _article_a9slj_1" data-testid="tile-zone-large-list_testID"><div class="articleContent _articleContent_a9slj_226"><div class="_title_a9slj_11"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/masterpieces-a-virtual-experience-of-the-museo-del-prado" class="" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><h3 class="_h3_c6c0h_1" data-testid="tile-title_testID"><span>11.</span>&nbsp;Masterpieces: A Virtual Experience of the Museo del Prado</h3></a></div><div class="_tileTags_a9slj_52"><section class="_tags_1i2cm_17" data-testid="tags_testID"><ul class="_tagsList_1i2cm_17"><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Things to do</span></li></ul></section></div><div class="_imageContainer_a9slj_48"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/masterpieces-a-virtual-experience-of-the-museo-del-prado" class="tileImageLink" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapDesktop_a9slj_100"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106448849/400/225/image.webp 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448849/750/422/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448849/1024/576/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448849/1372/772/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448849/1536/864/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448849/1920/1080/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="422"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106448849/750/422/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106448849/400/225/image.jpg 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448849/750/422/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448849/1024/576/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448849/1372/772/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448849/1536/864/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448849/1920/1080/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-16-9" title="Masterpieces: A Virtual Experience of the Museo del Prado" alt="Masterpieces: A Virtual Experience of the Museo del Prado" width="750" height="422" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapMobile_a9slj_205"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106448849/380/285/image.webp 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448849/750/562/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448849/1024/768/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448849/1372/1029/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448849/1536/1152/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448849/1920/1440/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="562"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106448849/750/562/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106448849/380/285/image.jpg 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448849/750/562/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448849/1024/768/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448849/1372/1029/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448849/1536/1152/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448849/1920/1440/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-4-3" title="Masterpieces: A Virtual Experience of the Museo del Prado" alt="Masterpieces: A Virtual Experience of the Museo del Prado" width="750" height="562" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><figcaption class="_figcaption_18vpl_1" data-testid="image-credits_testID"><span>Photograph: Courtesy of ACCIONA Cultura, Museo del Prado, and Powerhouse Arts</span></figcaption></a></div><div class="_summaryContainer_a9slj_361"><div class="_summary_a9slj_23"><div class="_p_1mmxl_1" data-testid="summary_testID"><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta charset="utf-8" />
<p>You can visit&nbsp;one of the most well-known museums in Spain<span>&nbsp;</span>without booking a flight.&nbsp;<em>Masterpieces: A Virtual Experience of the Museo del Prado</em>&nbsp;makes its US premiere at Powerhouse Arts in Brooklyn from October 1 through December 20. Developed by ACCIONA Cultura in collaboration with Madrid's Museo Nacional del Prado, the immersive VR experience transports visitors inside five iconic paintings, including<span>&nbsp;</span>Diego Vel&aacute;zquez&rsquo;s &ldquo;Las Meninas,&rdquo;<span>&nbsp;</span>Hieronymus Bosch&rsquo;s &ldquo;The Garden of Earthly Delights,&rdquo;<span>&nbsp;</span>Francisco Goya&rsquo;s &ldquo;Witches&rsquo; Sabbath,&rdquo;<span>&nbsp;</span>Paolo Veronese&rsquo;s &ldquo;Venus and Adonis&rdquo; and<span>&nbsp;</span>Peter Paul Rubens and<span>&nbsp;</span>Jan Brueghel's &ldquo;The Sense of Sight.&rdquo; A fictional museum security guard narrates the journey, turning the works into three-dimensional worlds visitors can explore.</p>
<p>General admission tickets cost $30, children between eight and 12 can enter for $8, students for $16, veterans, seniors and visitors with disabilities for $20.</p></div></div></div><div class="_ctaButtons_a9slj_109"><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _viewMoreCta_a9slj_130"><a class="_secondary_1gagn_22" href="/newyork/things-to-do/masterpieces-a-virtual-experience-of-the-museo-del-prado" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;read more button&quot;}}" data-testid="view-more-cta_testID"><span class="_textContent_1gagn_69">Read more</span></a></div></div></div></article><article class="tile _article_a9slj_1" data-testid="tile-zone-large-list_testID"><div class="articleContent _articleContent_a9slj_226"><div class="_title_a9slj_11"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/the-best-events-for-oktoberfest-in-nyc" class="" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><h3 class="_h3_c6c0h_1" data-testid="tile-title_testID"><span>12.</span>&nbsp;Celebrate Oktoberfest across NYC</h3></a></div><div class="_tileTags_a9slj_52"><section class="_tags_1i2cm_17" data-testid="tags_testID"><ul class="_tagsList_1i2cm_17"><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Things to do</span></li><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Festivals</span></li></ul></section></div><div class="_imageContainer_a9slj_48"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/the-best-events-for-oktoberfest-in-nyc" class="tileImageLink" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapDesktop_a9slj_100"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106330948/400/225/image.webp 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106330948/750/422/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106330948/1024/576/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106330948/1372/772/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106330948/1536/864/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106330948/1920/1080/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="422"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106330948/750/422/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106330948/400/225/image.jpg 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106330948/750/422/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106330948/1024/576/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106330948/1372/772/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106330948/1536/864/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106330948/1920/1080/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-16-9" title="Celebrate Oktoberfest across NYC" alt="Celebrate Oktoberfest across NYC" width="750" height="422" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapMobile_a9slj_205"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106330948/380/285/image.webp 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106330948/750/562/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106330948/1024/768/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106330948/1372/1029/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106330948/1536/1152/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106330948/1920/1440/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="562"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106330948/750/562/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106330948/380/285/image.jpg 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106330948/750/562/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106330948/1024/768/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106330948/1372/1029/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106330948/1536/1152/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106330948/1920/1440/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-4-3" title="Celebrate Oktoberfest across NYC" alt="Celebrate Oktoberfest across NYC" width="750" height="562" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><figcaption class="_figcaption_18vpl_1" data-testid="image-credits_testID"><span>Photograph: Courtesy Fairmont Miramar Hotel & Bungalows</span></figcaption></a></div><div class="_summaryContainer_a9slj_361"><div class="_summary_a9slj_23"><div class="_p_1mmxl_1" data-testid="summary_testID"><meta charset="utf-8" />
<p>Oktoberfestivities have kicked off at bars and beer halls all across New York City. Grab your&nbsp;beer stein, rev up your appetite and head on over to one of the many celebrations that are already underway.</p>
<p>Find your weekday, weekend or even weeklong plans on<span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.timeout.com/newyork/things-to-do/the-best-events-for-oktoberfest-in-nyc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">our list of the best Oktoberfest events happening this year</a>.</p></div></div></div><div class="_ctaButtons_a9slj_109"><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _viewMoreCta_a9slj_130"><a class="_secondary_1gagn_22" href="/newyork/things-to-do/the-best-events-for-oktoberfest-in-nyc" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;read more button&quot;}}" data-testid="view-more-cta_testID"><span class="_textContent_1gagn_69">Read more</span></a></div></div></div></article><div class="_adsInline_1t43t_10"><div data-testid="inline-generated-ad_testID" class="_inlineAdWrapper_16tbe_72 containerAdWrapper"><div class="_inlineAdContainer_16tbe_67"><span class="caps xs-block xs-text-10 xs-mb2 xs-text-center _inlineAdHeader_16tbe_82">Advertising</span><div class="_inlineAd_16tbe_67"><div id="ad-list-6-5916" class="_ad_16tbe_1 containerAd _ad-list_16tbe_61 " data-testid="ad_testID"><script>
