                    </script></div></div></div></div></div><article class="tile _article_a9slj_1" data-testid="tile-zone-large-list_testID"><div class="articleContent _articleContent_a9slj_226"><div class="_title_a9slj_11"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/thomas-hart-benton-a-picture-of-america-in-its-entirety" class="" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><h3 class="_h3_c6c0h_1" data-testid="tile-title_testID"><span>13.</span>&nbsp;Thomas Hart Benton: A Picture of America in Its Entirety</h3></a></div><div class="_tileTags_a9slj_52"><section class="_tags_1i2cm_17" data-testid="tags_testID"><ul class="_tagsList_1i2cm_17"><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Things to do</span></li></ul></section></div><div class="_imageContainer_a9slj_48"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/thomas-hart-benton-a-picture-of-america-in-its-entirety" class="tileImageLink" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapDesktop_a9slj_100"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106451096/400/225/image.webp 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106451096/750/422/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106451096/1024/576/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106451096/1372/772/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106451096/1536/864/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106451096/1920/1080/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="422"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106451096/750/422/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106451096/400/225/image.jpg 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106451096/750/422/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106451096/1024/576/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106451096/1372/772/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106451096/1536/864/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106451096/1920/1080/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-16-9" title="Thomas Hart Benton: A Picture of America in Its Entirety" alt="Thomas Hart Benton: A Picture of America in Its Entirety" width="750" height="422" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapMobile_a9slj_205"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106451096/380/285/image.webp 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106451096/750/562/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106451096/1024/768/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106451096/1372/1029/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106451096/1536/1152/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106451096/1920/1440/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="562"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106451096/750/562/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106451096/380/285/image.jpg 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106451096/750/562/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106451096/1024/768/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106451096/1372/1029/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106451096/1536/1152/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106451096/1920/1440/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-4-3" title="Thomas Hart Benton: A Picture of America in Its Entirety" alt="Thomas Hart Benton: A Picture of America in Its Entirety" width="750" height="562" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><figcaption class="_figcaption_18vpl_1" data-testid="image-credits_testID"><span>Photograph: Courtesy Schoelkopf Gallery</span></figcaption></a></div><div class="_summaryContainer_a9slj_361"><div class="_summary_a9slj_23"><div class="_p_1mmxl_1" data-testid="summary_testID"><meta charset="utf-8" />
<p><span>You have a few more weeks to take a fresh look at one of America&rsquo;s most complicated artistic chroniclers with&nbsp;</span><em>Thomas Hart Benton: A Picture of America in Its Entirety.</em><span>&nbsp;It's the first solo exhibition of the artist&rsquo;s work in New York in more than 10 years. Spanning five decades of Benton&rsquo;s career, the free Schoelkopf Gallery exhibition brings together major paintings, rarely seen works and studies for his celebrated murals, offering a sweeping look at his depictions of American life, labor, politics, race, industry and popular culture. The show also goes Hollywood, with two studies made for the 1955 Burt Lancaster film&nbsp;<em>The Kentuckian</em>, an original movie poster and a later Beam&rsquo;s Choice bottle featuring Benton&rsquo;s artwork. Coinciding with Schoelkopf Gallery&rsquo;s 25th anniversary and the United States Semiquincentennial, the exhibition runs through October 16.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="_ctaButtons_a9slj_109"><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _viewMoreCta_a9slj_130"><a class="_secondary_1gagn_22" href="/newyork/things-to-do/thomas-hart-benton-a-picture-of-america-in-its-entirety" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;read more button&quot;}}" data-testid="view-more-cta_testID"><span class="_textContent_1gagn_69">Read more</span></a></div></div></div></article><article class="tile _article_a9slj_1" data-testid="tile-zone-large-list_testID"><div class="articleContent _articleContent_a9slj_226"><div class="_title_a9slj_11"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/pierre-soulages-paintings-on-paper" class="" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><h3 class="_h3_c6c0h_1" data-testid="tile-title_testID"><span>14.</span>&nbsp;Pierre Soulages: Paintings on Paper</h3></a></div><div class="_tileTags_a9slj_52"><section class="_tags_1i2cm_17" data-testid="tags_testID"><ul class="_tagsList_1i2cm_17"><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Things to do</span></li><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Exhibitions</span></li></ul></section></div><div class="_imageContainer_a9slj_48"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/pierre-soulages-paintings-on-paper" class="tileImageLink" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapDesktop_a9slj_100"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106448850/400/225/image.webp 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448850/750/422/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448850/1024/576/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448850/1372/772/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448850/1536/864/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448850/1920/1080/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="422"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106448850/750/422/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106448850/400/225/image.jpg 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448850/750/422/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448850/1024/576/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448850/1372/772/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448850/1536/864/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448850/1920/1080/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-16-9" title="Pierre Soulages: Paintings on Paper" alt="Pierre Soulages: Paintings on Paper" width="750" height="422" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapMobile_a9slj_205"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106448850/380/285/image.webp 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448850/750/562/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448850/1024/768/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448850/1372/1029/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448850/1536/1152/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448850/1920/1440/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="562"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106448850/750/562/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106448850/380/285/image.jpg 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448850/750/562/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448850/1024/768/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448850/1372/1029/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448850/1536/1152/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448850/1920/1440/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-4-3" title="Pierre Soulages: Paintings on Paper" alt="Pierre Soulages: Paintings on Paper" width="750" height="562" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><figcaption class="_figcaption_18vpl_1" data-testid="image-credits_testID"><span>Photograph: Courtesy of the artist and Lévy Gorvy Dayan</span></figcaption></a></div><div class="_summaryContainer_a9slj_361"><div class="_summary_a9slj_23"><div class="_p_1mmxl_1" data-testid="summary_testID"><meta charset="utf-8" />
<p><span>Rare works by French master</span><span>&nbsp;Pierre Soulages are coming to the Upper East Side in a new exhibition at the L&eacute;vy Gorvy Dayan gallery (19 E. 64th St.). Organized with the artist&rsquo;s widow, the show features more than 20 paintings on paper, including works drawn directly from Soulages&rsquo;s estate that have never been exhibited publicly. Spanning decades of work, the exhibition explores a medium he prized for its immediacy and unforgiving nature, using walnut stain, gouache, ink and improvised tools to experiment with light, texture and transparency.&nbsp;</span></p></div></div></div><div class="_ctaButtons_a9slj_109"><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _viewMoreCta_a9slj_130"><a class="_secondary_1gagn_22" href="/newyork/things-to-do/pierre-soulages-paintings-on-paper" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;read more button&quot;}}" data-testid="view-more-cta_testID"><span class="_textContent_1gagn_69">Read more</span></a></div></div></div></article><div class="_adsInline_1t43t_10"><div data-testid="inline-generated-ad_testID" class="_inlineAdWrapper_16tbe_72 containerAdWrapper"><div class="_inlineAdContainer_16tbe_67"><span class="caps xs-block xs-text-10 xs-mb2 xs-text-center _inlineAdHeader_16tbe_82">Advertising</span><div class="_inlineAd_16tbe_67"><div id="ad-list-7-6727" class="_ad_16tbe_1 containerAd _ad-list_16tbe_61 " data-testid="ad_testID"><script>
