                    </script></div></div></div></div></div><article class="tile _article_a9slj_1" data-testid="tile-zone-large-list_testID"><div class="articleContent _articleContent_a9slj_226"><div class="_title_a9slj_11"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/twilight-zone-hidden-wonders-of-the-ocean" class="" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><h3 class="_h3_c6c0h_1" data-testid="tile-title_testID"><span>15.</span>&nbsp;Twilight Zone: Hidden Wonders of the Ocean</h3></a></div><div class="_tileTags_a9slj_52"><section class="_tags_1i2cm_17" data-testid="tags_testID"><ul class="_tagsList_1i2cm_17"><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Things to do</span></li><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Exhibitions</span></li></ul></section></div><div class="_imageContainer_a9slj_48"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/twilight-zone-hidden-wonders-of-the-ocean" class="tileImageLink" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapDesktop_a9slj_100"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106448847/400/225/image.webp 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448847/750/422/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448847/1024/576/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448847/1372/772/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448847/1536/864/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448847/1920/1080/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="422"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106448847/750/422/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106448847/400/225/image.jpg 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448847/750/422/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448847/1024/576/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448847/1372/772/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448847/1536/864/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448847/1920/1080/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-16-9" title="Twilight Zone: Hidden Wonders of the Ocean" alt="Twilight Zone: Hidden Wonders of the Ocean" width="750" height="422" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapMobile_a9slj_205"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106448847/380/285/image.webp 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448847/750/562/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448847/1024/768/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448847/1372/1029/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448847/1536/1152/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448847/1920/1440/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="562"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106448847/750/562/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106448847/380/285/image.jpg 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448847/750/562/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448847/1024/768/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448847/1372/1029/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448847/1536/1152/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106448847/1920/1440/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-4-3" title="Twilight Zone: Hidden Wonders of the Ocean" alt="Twilight Zone: Hidden Wonders of the Ocean" width="750" height="562" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><figcaption class="_figcaption_18vpl_1" data-testid="image-credits_testID"><span>Photograph: Courtesy ARTECHOUSE NYC</span></figcaption></a></div><div class="_summaryContainer_a9slj_361"><div class="_summary_a9slj_23"><div class="_p_1mmxl_1" data-testid="summary_testID"><p>Forget space&mdash;the ocean is the final frontier. And see why as you dive hundreds of feet beneath the ocean&rsquo;s surface without leaving Chelsea at <em>Twilight Zone: Hidden Wonders of the Ocean,</em>&nbsp;opening September 19 at ARTECHOUSE NYC (439 W. 15th St.). Created in collaboration with Woods Hole Oceanographic Institution, the immersive exhibition uses real deep-ocean footage, biological research, sound, interactivity and ocean technology to explore the mysterious &ldquo;twilight zone,&rdquo; a rarely seen region where creatures produce their own light and billions of animals migrate each night. The experience highlights the deep sea&rsquo;s role in ocean health and carbon movement while bringing its otherworldly ecosystems to life on a massive scale.&nbsp;</p></div></div></div><div class="_ctaButtons_a9slj_109"><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _viewMoreCta_a9slj_130"><a class="_secondary_1gagn_22" href="/newyork/things-to-do/twilight-zone-hidden-wonders-of-the-ocean" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;read more button&quot;}}" data-testid="view-more-cta_testID"><span class="_textContent_1gagn_69">Read more</span></a></div></div></div></article><article class="tile _article_a9slj_1" data-testid="tile-zone-large-list_testID"><div class="articleContent _articleContent_a9slj_226"><div class="_title_a9slj_11"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/trivia-fridays-debuts-at-courtside-at-pier-6" class="" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><h3 class="_h3_c6c0h_1" data-testid="tile-title_testID"><span>16.</span>&nbsp;Trivia Fridays at Courtside at Pier 6</h3></a></div><div class="_tileTags_a9slj_52"><section class="_tags_1i2cm_17" data-testid="tags_testID"><ul class="_tagsList_1i2cm_17"><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Things to do</span></li><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Games and hobbies</span></li></ul></section></div><div class="_imageContainer_a9slj_48"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/trivia-fridays-debuts-at-courtside-at-pier-6" class="tileImageLink" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapDesktop_a9slj_100"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/105876028/400/225/image.webp 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105876028/750/422/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105876028/1024/576/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105876028/1372/772/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105876028/1536/864/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105876028/1920/1080/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="422"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/105876028/750/422/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/105876028/400/225/image.jpg 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105876028/750/422/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105876028/1024/576/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105876028/1372/772/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105876028/1536/864/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105876028/1920/1080/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-16-9" title="Trivia Fridays at Courtside at Pier 6" alt="Trivia Fridays at Courtside at Pier 6" width="750" height="422" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapMobile_a9slj_205"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/105876028/380/285/image.webp 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105876028/750/562/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105876028/1024/768/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105876028/1372/1029/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105876028/1536/1152/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105876028/1920/1440/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="562"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/105876028/750/562/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/105876028/380/285/image.jpg 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105876028/750/562/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105876028/1024/768/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105876028/1372/1029/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105876028/1536/1152/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105876028/1920/1440/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-4-3" title="Trivia Fridays at Courtside at Pier 6" alt="Trivia Fridays at Courtside at Pier 6" width="750" height="562" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><figcaption class="_figcaption_18vpl_1" data-testid="image-credits_testID"><span>Photograph: Courtesy of Noah Fecks</span></figcaption></a></div><div class="_summaryContainer_a9slj_361"><div class="_summary_a9slj_23"><div class="_p_1mmxl_1" data-testid="summary_testID"><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta charset="utf-8" />
<p><span>Turn Friday nights into a sunset-to-trivia doubleheader with Fornino (Courtside at Pier 6).&nbsp;</span><span>Weekly Trivia Fridays is a new, waterside game that made its debut September 25 and is presented by&nbsp;</span><a href="https://nyctrivialeague.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NYC Trivia League</a><span>. The free game kicks off at 7pm, with teams answering questions from their phones and competing for prizes. While you&nbsp;<em>can</em>&nbsp;go once and then never again, the publicly available weekly standings will probably have you going back for more&mdash;rather, for vengeance against whatever team beat you by a hair.&nbsp;Consider it&nbsp;an easy TGIF excuse to eat, drink and prove to strangers that you know entirely too&nbsp;</span><span>many</span><span>&nbsp;random facts.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="_ctaButtons_a9slj_109"><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _viewMoreCta_a9slj_130"><a class="_secondary_1gagn_22" href="/newyork/things-to-do/trivia-fridays-debuts-at-courtside-at-pier-6" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;read more button&quot;}}" data-testid="view-more-cta_testID"><span class="_textContent_1gagn_69">Read more</span></a></div></div></div></article><div class="_adsInline_1t43t_10"><div data-testid="inline-generated-ad_testID" class="_inlineAdWrapper_16tbe_72 containerAdWrapper"><div class="_inlineAdContainer_16tbe_67"><span class="caps xs-block xs-text-10 xs-mb2 xs-text-center _inlineAdHeader_16tbe_82">Advertising</span><div class="_inlineAd_16tbe_67"><div id="ad-list-8-2069" class="_ad_16tbe_1 containerAd _ad-list_16tbe_61 " data-testid="ad_testID"><script>
