                    </script></div></div></div></div></div><article class="tile _article_a9slj_1" data-testid="tile-zone-large-list_testID"><div class="articleContent _articleContent_a9slj_226"><div class="_title_a9slj_11"><a href="/newyork/news/this-new-times-square-arts-exhibition-explores-the-neighborhoods-seedy-history-of-sex-clubs-and-debauchery-091526" class="" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><h3 class="_h3_c6c0h_1" data-testid="tile-title_testID"><span>17.</span>&nbsp;This new Times Square arts exhibition explores the neighborhood’s seedy history of sex clubs and debauchery</h3></a></div><div class="_tileTags_a9slj_52"><section class="_tags_1i2cm_17" data-testid="tags_testID"><ul class="_tagsList_1i2cm_17"><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Art</span></li></ul></section></div><div class="_imageContainer_a9slj_48"><a href="/newyork/news/this-new-times-square-arts-exhibition-explores-the-neighborhoods-seedy-history-of-sex-clubs-and-debauchery-091526" class="tileImageLink" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapDesktop_a9slj_100"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106447550/400/225/image.webp 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106447550/750/422/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106447550/1024/576/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106447550/1372/772/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106447550/1536/864/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106447550/1920/1080/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="422"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106447550/750/422/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106447550/400/225/image.jpg 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106447550/750/422/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106447550/1024/576/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106447550/1372/772/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106447550/1536/864/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106447550/1920/1080/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-16-9" title="This new Times Square arts exhibition explores the neighborhood’s seedy history of sex clubs and debauchery" alt="This new Times Square arts exhibition explores the neighborhood’s seedy history of sex clubs and debauchery" width="750" height="422" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapMobile_a9slj_205"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106447550/380/285/image.webp 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106447550/750/562/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106447550/1024/768/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106447550/1372/1029/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106447550/1536/1152/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106447550/1920/1440/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="562"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106447550/750/562/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106447550/380/285/image.jpg 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106447550/750/562/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106447550/1024/768/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106447550/1372/1029/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106447550/1536/1152/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106447550/1920/1440/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-4-3" title="This new Times Square arts exhibition explores the neighborhood’s seedy history of sex clubs and debauchery" alt="This new Times Square arts exhibition explores the neighborhood’s seedy history of sex clubs and debauchery" width="750" height="562" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><figcaption class="_figcaption_18vpl_1" data-testid="image-credits_testID"><span>Photograph: Shutterstock</span></figcaption></a></div><div class="_summaryContainer_a9slj_361"><div class="_summary_a9slj_23"><div class="_p_1mmxl_1" data-testid="summary_testID"><meta charset="utf-8" />
<p>A new exhibition in&nbsp;<a href="https://www.timeout.com/newyork/things-to-do/new-york-attractions-times-square">Times Square</a>&nbsp;is looking back at the sex clubs, peep shows and adult theaters that once crowded the neighborhood.</p>
<p data-start="370" data-end="742"><em><a href="https://www.timessquare.art/#/live-sex-acts/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Live Sex Acts</a>&nbsp;</em>opens Friday, September 18, at <a href="https://www.timessquare.art/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Times Square Space</a>, bringing together photographs and artworks by Vivienne Maricevic, Scott Ewalt and Alix Vernet. Despite its name, the show features no live performances. It&rsquo;s an 18-and-over exhibition about the adult venues that flourished from the late 1960s through the mid-1980s&mdash;and what happened when they disappeared.</p>
<p data-start="370" data-end="742"><strong>Read more about the exhibit <a href="https://www.timeout.com/newyork/news/this-new-times-square-arts-exhibition-explores-the-neighborhoods-seedy-history-of-sex-clubs-and-debauchery-091526" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">here</a>.</strong></p>
<p data-start="1197" data-end="1713"><em data-start="2378" data-end="2393">Live Sex Acts</em> runs through November 15 and is open Thursday through Saturday from noon to 6pm or by appointment. The opening event takes place September 18 from 6 to 9pm. Expect explicit imagery and mature themes.</p></div></div></div><div class="_ctaButtons_a9slj_109"><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _viewMoreCta_a9slj_130"><a class="_secondary_1gagn_22" href="/newyork/news/this-new-times-square-arts-exhibition-explores-the-neighborhoods-seedy-history-of-sex-clubs-and-debauchery-091526" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;read more button&quot;}}" data-testid="view-more-cta_testID"><span class="_textContent_1gagn_69">Read more</span></a></div></div></div></article><article class="tile _article_a9slj_1" data-testid="tile-zone-large-list_testID"><div class="articleContent _articleContent_a9slj_226"><div class="_title_a9slj_11"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/untethered-works" class="" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><h3 class="_h3_c6c0h_1" data-testid="tile-title_testID"><span>18.</span>&nbsp;Untethered Works</h3></a></div><div class="_tileTags_a9slj_52"><section class="_tags_1i2cm_17" data-testid="tags_testID"><ul class="_tagsList_1i2cm_17"><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Things to do</span></li></ul></section></div><div class="_imageContainer_a9slj_48"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/untethered-works" class="tileImageLink" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapDesktop_a9slj_100"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106437405/400/225/image.webp 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106437405/750/422/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106437405/1024/576/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106437405/1372/772/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106437405/1536/864/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106437405/1920/1080/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="422"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106437405/750/422/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106437405/400/225/image.jpg 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106437405/750/422/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106437405/1024/576/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106437405/1372/772/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106437405/1536/864/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106437405/1920/1080/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-16-9" title="Untethered Works" alt="Untethered Works" width="750" height="422" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapMobile_a9slj_205"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106437405/380/285/image.webp 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106437405/750/562/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106437405/1024/768/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106437405/1372/1029/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106437405/1536/1152/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106437405/1920/1440/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="562"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106437405/750/562/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106437405/380/285/image.jpg 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106437405/750/562/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106437405/1024/768/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106437405/1372/1029/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106437405/1536/1152/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106437405/1920/1440/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-4-3" title="Untethered Works" alt="Untethered Works" width="750" height="562" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><figcaption class="_figcaption_18vpl_1" data-testid="image-credits_testID"><span>Photograph: Peggy Black</span></figcaption></a></div><div class="_summaryContainer_a9slj_361"><div class="_summary_a9slj_23"><div class="_p_1mmxl_1" data-testid="summary_testID"><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta charset="utf-8" />
<p>Textiles&nbsp;are&nbsp;a lot more than couture or the fabric you're sitting on right now&mdash;assuming you're on the couch.<span>&nbsp;</span><em>Untethered Works</em>, a new exhibit at the Textile Art Gallery (529 W 20th St, 6th Fl.), brings together contemporary artists exploring what happens when fiber escapes its traditional boundaries. Artists Peggy Black, Julia Graziano and Sarah Pavlik showcase works that push fabric, thread and other materials into sculptural, tactile and often unexpectedly expressive territory. Forget what you think you know about embroidery&mdash;these artists treat textiles as a serious medium for abstraction and experimentation.</p>
<p>There are also two special events on September 10 in celebration of&nbsp;New York Textile Month XI: a talk with the artists midday, and the opening reception&nbsp;in the&nbsp;early evening. All events are free, just <a href="https://www.textileartnyc.com/untethered-works">register online</a>.</p></div></div></div><div class="_ctaButtons_a9slj_109"><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _viewMoreCta_a9slj_130"><a class="_secondary_1gagn_22" href="/newyork/things-to-do/untethered-works" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;read more button&quot;}}" data-testid="view-more-cta_testID"><span class="_textContent_1gagn_69">Read more</span></a></div></div></div></article><div class="_adsInline_1t43t_10"><div data-testid="inline-generated-ad_testID" class="_inlineAdWrapper_16tbe_72 containerAdWrapper"><div class="_inlineAdContainer_16tbe_67"><span class="caps xs-block xs-text-10 xs-mb2 xs-text-center _inlineAdHeader_16tbe_82">Advertising</span><div class="_inlineAd_16tbe_67"><div id="ad-list-9-3914" class="_ad_16tbe_1 containerAd _ad-list_16tbe_61 " data-testid="ad_testID"><script>
