                    </script></div></div></div></div></div><article class="tile _article_a9slj_1" data-testid="tile-zone-large-list_testID"><div class="articleContent _articleContent_a9slj_226"><div class="_title_a9slj_11"><a href="/time-out-market-union-square/sports-and-fitness/catch-all-the-womens-basketball-games-at-time-out-new-york-new-york" class="" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><h3 class="_h3_c6c0h_1" data-testid="tile-title_testID"><span>19.</span>&nbsp;Catch all the Women’s Basketball Games at Time Out New York, New York</h3></a></div><div class="_tileTags_a9slj_52"><section class="_tags_1i2cm_17" data-testid="tags_testID"><ul class="_tagsList_1i2cm_17"><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Sports and fitness</span></li></ul></section></div><div class="_imageContainer_a9slj_48"><a href="/time-out-market-union-square/sports-and-fitness/catch-all-the-womens-basketball-games-at-time-out-new-york-new-york" class="tileImageLink" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapDesktop_a9slj_100"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106425215/400/225/image.webp 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106425215/750/422/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106425215/1024/576/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106425215/1372/772/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106425215/1536/864/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106425215/1920/1080/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="422"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106425215/750/422/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106425215/400/225/image.jpg 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106425215/750/422/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106425215/1024/576/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106425215/1372/772/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106425215/1536/864/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106425215/1920/1080/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-16-9" title="Catch all the Women’s Basketball Games at Time Out New York, New York" alt="Catch all the Women’s Basketball Games at Time Out New York, New York" width="750" height="422" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapMobile_a9slj_205"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106425215/380/285/image.webp 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106425215/750/562/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106425215/1024/768/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106425215/1372/1029/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106425215/1536/1152/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106425215/1920/1440/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="562"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106425215/750/562/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106425215/380/285/image.jpg 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106425215/750/562/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106425215/1024/768/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106425215/1372/1029/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106425215/1536/1152/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106425215/1920/1440/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-4-3" title="Catch all the Women’s Basketball Games at Time Out New York, New York" alt="Catch all the Women’s Basketball Games at Time Out New York, New York" width="750" height="562" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><figcaption class="_figcaption_18vpl_1" data-testid="image-credits_testID"><span>Photography Noah Fecks</span></figcaption></a></div><div class="_summaryContainer_a9slj_361"><div class="_summary_a9slj_23"><div class="_p_1mmxl_1" data-testid="summary_testID"><meta charset="utf-8" />
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">New York Liberty fans,&nbsp;your game day center is here.&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</p>
<p><a class="editor-rtfLink" href="https://www.timeout.com/time-out-market-union-square" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Time Out Market New York, Union Square</span></a><span data-preserver-spaces="true">, is screening all&nbsp;</span><span data-preserver-spaces="true">of</span><span data-preserver-spaces="true">&nbsp;the women's basketball games&mdash;and you know who we'll be rooting for</span><span data-preserver-spaces="true">.</span><span data-preserver-spaces="true">&nbsp;Catch the games on all eight of our TVs across our Market,&nbsp;including the massive dropdown screen</span><span data-preserver-spaces="true">. Cheer on your favorite team while enjoying killer cocktails and pitchers of beers alongside incredible game-day bites from each of our kitchens.&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Here's the current list of matchups:</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">August 8: New York Liberty vs. Las Vegas Aces | 12:30 PM</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">August 13: New York Liberty vs. Los Angeles Sparks | 8:00 PM</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">August 15: New York Liberty vs. Connecticut Sun | 1:00 PM</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">August 22: New York Liberty vs. Indiana Fever | 7:00 PM</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">August 28: New York Liberty vs. Golden State Valkyries | 8:00 PM</span></p></div></div></div><div class="_ctaButtons_a9slj_109"><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _viewMoreCta_a9slj_130"><a class="_secondary_1gagn_22" href="/time-out-market-union-square/sports-and-fitness/catch-all-the-womens-basketball-games-at-time-out-new-york-new-york" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;read more button&quot;}}" data-testid="view-more-cta_testID"><span class="_textContent_1gagn_69">Read more</span></a></div><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _bookingCta_a9slj_131"><a class="_a_1fa6w_1" href="https://www.timeout.com/time-out-market-union-square" data-testid="buy-now-button_testID" target="_self" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;label&quot;:&quot;ev booking&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;affiliate_partner&quot;:&quot;other&quot;,&quot;affiliate_link_type&quot;:&quot;button&quot;,&quot;affiliate_link_location&quot;:&quot;list&quot;,&quot;affiliate_superlist_position&quot;:19}}">Buy ticket</a></div></div></div></article><article class="tile _article_a9slj_1" data-testid="tile-zone-large-list_testID"><div class="articleContent _articleContent_a9slj_226"><div class="_title_a9slj_11"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/xanadu-day-disco" class="" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><h3 class="_h3_c6c0h_1" data-testid="tile-title_testID"><span>20.</span>&nbsp;Xanadu Day Disco</h3></a></div><div class="_tileTags_a9slj_52"><section class="_tags_1i2cm_17" data-testid="tags_testID"><ul class="_tagsList_1i2cm_17"><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Things to do</span></li></ul></section></div><div class="_imageContainer_a9slj_48"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/xanadu-day-disco" class="tileImageLink" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapDesktop_a9slj_100"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106152387/400/225/image.webp 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106152387/750/422/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106152387/1024/576/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106152387/1372/772/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106152387/1536/864/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106152387/1920/1080/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="422"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106152387/750/422/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106152387/400/225/image.jpg 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106152387/750/422/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106152387/1024/576/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106152387/1372/772/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106152387/1536/864/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106152387/1920/1080/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-16-9" title="Xanadu Day Disco" alt="Xanadu Day Disco" width="750" height="422" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapMobile_a9slj_205"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106152387/380/285/image.webp 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106152387/750/562/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106152387/1024/768/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106152387/1372/1029/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106152387/1536/1152/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106152387/1920/1440/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="562"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106152387/750/562/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106152387/380/285/image.jpg 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106152387/750/562/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106152387/1024/768/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106152387/1372/1029/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106152387/1536/1152/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106152387/1920/1440/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-4-3" title="Xanadu Day Disco" alt="Xanadu Day Disco" width="750" height="562" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><figcaption class="_figcaption_18vpl_1" data-testid="image-credits_testID"><span>Photograph: Kenny Rodriguez</span></figcaption></a></div><div class="_summaryContainer_a9slj_361"><div class="_summary_a9slj_23"><div class="_p_1mmxl_1" data-testid="summary_testID"><meta charset="utf-8" />
<p>Every Saturday at Xanadu, combine two of the best (and most fun)&nbsp;things to come out of the '70s: disco and roller skating.&nbsp;Starting at noon,&nbsp;the Bushwick roller rink&nbsp;becomes&nbsp;your daytime playground for&nbsp;a glittery afternoon of skating, disco and general good times on wheels. The all-ages&nbsp;skate sesh runs until 6pm, with a soundtrack of disco, house and pop keeping the rink moving. Bring your own skates or rent a pair on-site to boogie down on Xanadu&rsquo;s 7,000-square-foot maple floor.&nbsp;Olivia Newton-John not included.</p>
<p>Trying to make it a group hang? If you've got seven or more people tagging along, you can<span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.xanadu.nyc/booking">reserve a booth</a>.</p></div></div></div><div class="_ctaButtons_a9slj_109"><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _viewMoreCta_a9slj_130"><a class="_secondary_1gagn_22" href="/newyork/things-to-do/xanadu-day-disco" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;read more button&quot;}}" data-testid="view-more-cta_testID"><span class="_textContent_1gagn_69">Read more</span></a></div><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _bookingCta_a9slj_131"><a class="_a_1fa6w_1" href="https://dice.fm/event/q2l3a9-xanadu-day-disco-skate-29th-aug-xanadu-new-york-city-tickets" data-testid="buy-now-button_testID" target="_blank" rel="nofollow" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;label&quot;:&quot;ev booking&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;affiliate_partner&quot;:&quot;other&quot;,&quot;affiliate_link_type&quot;:&quot;button&quot;,&quot;affiliate_link_location&quot;:&quot;list&quot;,&quot;affiliate_superlist_position&quot;:20}}">Buy ticket</a></div></div></div></article><div class="_adsInline_1t43t_10"><div data-testid="inline-generated-ad_testID" class="_inlineAdWrapper_16tbe_72 containerAdWrapper"><div class="_inlineAdContainer_16tbe_67"><span class="caps xs-block xs-text-10 xs-mb2 xs-text-center _inlineAdHeader_16tbe_82">Advertising</span><div class="_inlineAd_16tbe_67"><div id="ad-list-10-3905" class="_ad_16tbe_1 containerAd _ad-list_16tbe_61 " data-testid="ad_testID"><script>
