https://media.timeout.com/images/106437006/1024/576/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106437006/1372/772/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106437006/1536/864/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106437006/1920/1080/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-16-9" title="Hudson VU Summer Beats" alt="Hudson VU Summer Beats" width="750" height="422" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapMobile_a9slj_205"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106437006/380/285/image.webp 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106437006/750/562/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106437006/1024/768/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106437006/1372/1029/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106437006/1536/1152/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106437006/1920/1440/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="562"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106437006/750/562/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106437006/380/285/image.jpg 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106437006/750/562/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106437006/1024/768/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106437006/1372/1029/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106437006/1536/1152/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106437006/1920/1440/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-4-3" title="Hudson VU Summer Beats" alt="Hudson VU Summer Beats" width="750" height="562" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><figcaption class="_figcaption_18vpl_1" data-testid="image-credits_testID"><span>Photograph: Courtesy Hudson Vu</span></figcaption></a></div><div class="_summaryContainer_a9slj_361"><div class="_summary_a9slj_23"><div class="_p_1mmxl_1" data-testid="summary_testID"><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta charset="utf-8" />
<p><span>Before the sun starts to set at 4pm and we all plunge into seasonal woes, take advantage of every hot summer night by heading to&nbsp;</span><span>Sunset Beats at&nbsp;</span><span>Ink 48 Hotel's Hudson VU Rooftop Lounge (653 11th Ave.). The party runs on Saturdays and will be happening well into September this year.&nbsp;</span><span>D</span><span>inner and drinks kick off at 6pm&nbsp;</span><span>as the&nbsp;</span><span>resident DJ gradually turns the tempo up&nbsp;while the sun goes down. It&rsquo;s a low-key way to start the night&mdash;or a perfectly acceptable&nbsp;</span><span>way to spend a Saturday not on your couch</span><span>. Come for the sunset, stay for the music and let the city provide the scenery while the DJ handles the soundtrack.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="_ctaButtons_a9slj_109"><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _viewMoreCta_a9slj_130"><a class="_secondary_1gagn_22" href="/newyork/things-to-do/hudson-vu-summer-beats" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;read more button&quot;}}" data-testid="view-more-cta_testID"><span class="_textContent_1gagn_69">Read more</span></a></div><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _bookingCta_a9slj_131"><a class="_a_1fa6w_1" href="https://www.exploretock.com/hudson-vu-new-york/" data-testid="buy-now-button_testID" target="_blank" rel="nofollow" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;label&quot;:&quot;ev booking&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;affiliate_partner&quot;:&quot;other&quot;,&quot;affiliate_link_type&quot;:&quot;button&quot;,&quot;affiliate_link_location&quot;:&quot;list&quot;,&quot;affiliate_superlist_position&quot;:21}}">Buy ticket</a></div></div></div></article><article class="tile _article_a9slj_1" data-testid="tile-zone-large-list_testID"><div class="articleContent _articleContent_a9slj_226"><div class="_title_a9slj_11"><a href="/movies/heart-of-the-beast-review-2026" class="" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><h3 class="_h3_c6c0h_1" data-testid="tile-title_testID"><span>22.</span>&nbsp;Heart of the Beast</h3></a></div><div class="_tileTags_a9slj_52"><section class="_tags_1i2cm_17" data-testid="tags_testID"><ul class="_tagsList_1i2cm_17"><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Movies</span></li><li class="_tagBare_1i2cm_27 _tagComponent_1i2cm_63"><div class="_ratingStars_1qrzr_1" data-testid="star-rating_testID"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 17" class=""><path d="M6.33769 6.52364L8 3.37242L9.66231 6.52364C9.77389 6.73515 9.9808 6.87971 10.2178 6.91171L13.8712 7.40509L11.2617 9.78263C11.0729 9.9546 10.9862 10.2117 11.0321 10.4629L11.6539 13.859L8.32615 12.225C8.12045 12.124 7.87955 12.124 7.67385 12.225L4.34612 13.859L4.96785 10.4629C5.01383 10.2117 4.92708 9.9546 4.73833 9.78263L2.12884 7.40509L5.78221 6.91171C6.0192 6.87971 6.22611 6.73515 6.33769 6.52364Z"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 17" class=""><path d="M6.33769 6.52364L8 3.37242L9.66231 6.52364C9.77389 6.73515 9.9808 6.87971 10.2178 6.91171L13.8712 7.40509L11.2617 9.78263C11.0729 9.9546 10.9862 10.2117 11.0321 10.4629L11.6539 13.859L8.32615 12.225C8.12045 12.124 7.87955 12.124 7.67385 12.225L4.34612 13.859L4.96785 10.4629C5.01383 10.2117 4.92708 9.9546 4.73833 9.78263L2.12884 7.40509L5.78221 6.91171C6.0192 6.87971 6.22611 6.73515 6.33769 6.52364Z"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 17" class=""><path d="M6.33769 6.52364L8 3.37242L9.66231 6.52364C9.77389 6.73515 9.9808 6.87971 10.2178 6.91171L13.8712 7.40509L11.2617 9.78263C11.0729 9.9546 10.9862 10.2117 