                    </script></div></div></div></div></div><article class="tile _article_a9slj_1" data-testid="tile-zone-large-list_testID"><div class="articleContent _articleContent_a9slj_226"><div class="_title_a9slj_11"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/the-sing-easy" class="" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><h3 class="_h3_c6c0h_1" data-testid="tile-title_testID"><span>23.</span>&nbsp;The Sing Easy</h3></a></div><div class="_tileTags_a9slj_52"><section class="_tags_1i2cm_17" data-testid="tags_testID"><ul class="_tagsList_1i2cm_17"><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Things to do</span></li></ul></section></div><div class="_imageContainer_a9slj_48"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/the-sing-easy" class="tileImageLink" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapDesktop_a9slj_100"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106439629/400/225/image.webp 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106439629/750/422/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106439629/1024/576/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106439629/1372/772/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106439629/1536/864/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106439629/1920/1080/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="422"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106439629/750/422/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106439629/400/225/image.jpg 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106439629/750/422/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106439629/1024/576/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106439629/1372/772/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106439629/1536/864/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106439629/1920/1080/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-16-9" title="The Sing Easy" alt="The Sing Easy" width="750" height="422" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapMobile_a9slj_205"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106439629/380/285/image.webp 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106439629/750/562/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106439629/1024/768/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106439629/1372/1029/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106439629/1536/1152/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106439629/1920/1440/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="562"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106439629/750/562/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106439629/380/285/image.jpg 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106439629/750/562/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106439629/1024/768/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106439629/1372/1029/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106439629/1536/1152/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106439629/1920/1440/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-4-3" title="The Sing Easy" alt="The Sing Easy" width="750" height="562" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><figcaption class="_figcaption_18vpl_1" data-testid="image-credits_testID"><span>Photograph: Caroline King</span></figcaption></a></div><div class="_summaryContainer_a9slj_361"><div class="_summary_a9slj_23"><div class="_p_1mmxl_1" data-testid="summary_testID"><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta charset="utf-8" />
<p><span>Sometimes karaoke just doesn't cut it. For those who want the joy and release that singing provides, but maybe need to feel a little more confident doing it, there's The Sing Easy.&nbsp;</span><span>A</span><span>n 80-minute guided group voice session led by NYC voice educator and artist Jess McAvoy,&nbsp;</span><span>the evening uses</span><span>&nbsp;breathwork, vocal play and easy-to-learn original songs to help participants explore their voices. No singing experience or music reading abilities required&mdash;just show up and make a joyful noise. Sessions take place at Sprout Society (</span><span>26 Scott Ave.) in Brooklyn and on&nbsp;</span><span>150 West 28th Street,&nbsp;suite&nbsp;303,</span><span>&nbsp;in Manhattan through December. Tickets are tiered from $15 to $35. Upcoming dates include September 1, 10 and 24; October 8, 13 and 22; November 5, 10 and 19; December 3, 8 and 17.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="_ctaButtons_a9slj_109"><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _viewMoreCta_a9slj_130"><a class="_secondary_1gagn_22" href="/newyork/things-to-do/the-sing-easy" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;read more button&quot;}}" data-testid="view-more-cta_testID"><span class="_textContent_1gagn_69">Read more</span></a></div></div></div></article><article class="tile _article_a9slj_1" data-testid="tile-zone-large-list_testID"><div class="articleContent _articleContent_a9slj_226"><div class="_title_a9slj_11"><a href="/movies/it-ends-review-2026" class="" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><h3 class="_h3_c6c0h_1" data-testid="tile-title_testID"><span>24.</span>&nbsp;It Ends</h3></a></div><div class="_tileTags_a9slj_52"><section class="_tags_1i2cm_17" data-testid="tags_testID"><ul class="_tagsList_1i2cm_17"><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Movies</span></li><li class="_tagBare_1i2cm_27 _tagComponent_1i2cm_63"><div class="_ratingStars_1qrzr_1" data-testid="star-rating_testID"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 17" class=""><path d="M6.33769 6.52364L8 3.37242L9.66231 6.52364C9.77389 6.73515 9.9808 6.87971 10.2178 6.91171L13.8712 7.40509L11.2617 9.78263C11.0729 9.9546 10.9862 10.2117 11.0321 10.4629L11.6539 13.859L8.32615 12.225C8.12045 12.124 7.87955 12.124 7.67385 12.225L4.34612 13.859L4.96785 10.4629C5.01383 10.2117 4.92708 9.9546 4.73833 9.78263L2.12884 7.40509L5.78221 6.91171C6.0192 6.87971 6.22611 6.73515 6.33769 6.52364Z"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 17" class=""><path d="M6.33769 6.52364L8 3.37242L9.66231 6.52364C9.77389 6.73515 9.9808 6.87971 10.2178 6.91171L13.8712 7.40509L11.2617 9.78263C11.0729 9.9546 10.9862 10.2117 11.0321 10.4629L11.6539 13.859L8.32615 12.225C8.12045 12.124 7.87955 12.124 7.67385 12.225L4.34612 13.859L4.96785 10.4629C5.01383 10.2117 4.92708 9.9546 4.73833 9.78263L2.12884 7.40509L5.78221 6.91171C6.0192 6.87971 6.22611 6.73515 6.33769 6.52364Z"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 17" class=""><path d="M6.33769 6.52364L8 3.37242L9.66231 6.52364C9.77389 6.73515 9.9808 6.87971 10.2178 6.91171L13.8712 7.40509L11.2617 9.78263C11.0729 9.9546 10.9862 10.2117 11.0321 10.4629L11.6539 13.859L8.32615 12.225C8.12045 12.124 7.87955 12.124 7.67385 12.225L4.34612 13.859L4.96785 10.4629C5.01383 10.2117 4.92708 9.9546 4.73833 9.78263L2.12884 7.40509L5.78221 6.91171C6.0192 6.87971 6.22611 6.73515 6.33769 6.52364Z"></path></svg><div class="_unfilledRating_1qrzr_18"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 32 32" class=""><path d="M22.3061 19.667L22.798 19.5769L22.3061 19.667L23.6694 27.1137L16.4319 23.5601C16.1595 23.4263 15.8405 23.4263 15.5681 23.5601L8.33056 27.1137L9.69388 19.667C9.75477 19.3343 9.63988 18.9938 9.38992 18.7661L9.05317 19.1357L9.38992 18.7661L3.62884 13.5171L11.6519 12.4336C11.9658 12.3912 12.2398 12.1998 12.3876 11.9196L16 5.07164L19.6124 11.9196C19.7602 12.1998 20.0342 12.3912 20.3481 12.4336L28.3712 13.5171L22.6101 18.7661C22.3601 18.9938 22.2452 19.3343 22.3061 19.667Z"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 32 32" class=""><path d="M22.3061 19.667L22.798 19.5769L22.3061 19.667L23.6694 27.1137L16.4319 23.5601C16.1595 23.4263 15.8405 23.4263 15.5681 23.5601L8.33056 27.1137L9.69388 19.667C9.75477 19.3343 9.63988 18.9938 9.38992 18.7661L9.05317 19.1357L9.38992 18.7661L3.62884 13.5171L11.6519 12.4336C11.9658 12.3912 12.2398 12.1998 12.3876 11.9196L16 5.07164L19.6124 11.9196C19.7602 12.1998 20.0342 12.3912 20.3481 12.4336L28.3712 13.5171L22.6101 18.7661C22.3601 18.9938 22.2452 19.3343 22.3061 19.667Z"></path></svg></div><span class="sr-only">3 out of 5 stars</span></div></li><li class="_tagBare_1i2cm_27 _tagComponent_1i2cm_63"><div class="_container_12ex6_1" data-testid="recommended_testID"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="_svg_12ex6_10"><path d="M20 6L9 17L4 12" stroke="#e1192c" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="_title_12ex6_24">Recommended</span></div></li></ul></section></div><div class="_imageContainer_a9slj_48"><a href="/movies/it-ends-review-2026" class="tileImageLink" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapDesktop_a9slj_100"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106436234/400/225/image.webp 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436234/750/422/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436234/1024/576/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436234/1372/772/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436234/1536/864/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436234/1920/1080/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="422"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106436234/750/422/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106436234/400/225/image.jpg 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436234/750/422/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436234/1024/576/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436234/1372/772/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436234/1536/864/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436234/1920/1080/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-16-9" title="It Ends" alt="It Ends" width="750" height="422" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapMobile_a9slj_205"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106436234/380/285/image.webp 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436234/750/562/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436234/1024/768/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436234/1372/1029/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436234/1536/1152/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436234/1920/1440/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="562"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106436234/750/562/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106436234/380/285/image.jpg 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436234/750/562/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436234/1024/768/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436234/1372/1029/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436234/1536/1152/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436234/1920/1440/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-4-3" title="It Ends" alt="It Ends" width="750" height="562" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><figcaption class="_figcaption_18vpl_1" data-testid="image-credits_testID"><span>Photograph: Neon</span></figcaption></a></div><div class="_summaryContainer_a9slj_361"><div class="_summary_a9slj_23"><div class="_p_1mmxl_1" data-testid="summary_testID"><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">If circular logic alone is enough to irritate you, <em>I</em></span><em>t Ends</em> definitely isn&rsquo;t your movie.</p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">It's&nbsp;a movie in which four friends literally drive around in circles&mdash;forever. Soon after Tyler (Mitchell Cole) picks up fellow Gen Zers James (Phinehas Yoon), Day (Akira Jackson) and Fisher (Noah Toth) for a night out, they realise they&rsquo;ve misread the GPS and missed their turn. Then they discover that there is</span> <span style="font-weight: 400;">no turn. And finally, it dawns on them that there is no exit at all. They&rsquo;re just stuck on an unfamiliar two-lane country road, surrounded by forest on both sides, indefinitely.&nbsp;</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">It gets worse when they stretch their legs and are almost immediately beset upon by zombies. Or </span><em><span style="font-weight: 400;">are</span></em><span style="font-weight: 400;"> they zombies? Maybe they&rsquo;re just other people who eventually went crazy driving down the same road forever. Either way, things are not looking great.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;"></span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><em>In US theaters Friday August 21.</em></span></p></div></div></div><div class="_ctaButtons_a9slj_109"><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _viewMoreCta_a9slj_130"><a class="_secondary_1gagn_22" href="/movies/it-ends-review-2026" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;read more button&quot;}}" data-testid="view-more-cta_testID"><span class="_textContent_1gagn_69">Read review</span></a></div></div></div></article><div class="_adsInline_1t43t_10"><div data-testid="inline-generated-ad_testID" class="_inlineAdWrapper_16tbe_72 containerAdWrapper"><div class="_inlineAdContainer_16tbe_67"><span class="caps xs-block xs-text-10 xs-mb2 xs-text-center _inlineAdHeader_16tbe_82">Advertising</span><div class="_inlineAd_16tbe_67"><div id="ad-list-12-3642" class="_ad_16tbe_1 containerAd _ad-list_16tbe_61 " data-testid="ad_testID"><script>
