c" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="_title_12ex6_24">Recommended</span></div></li></ul></section></div><div class="_imageContainer_a9slj_48"><a href="/movies/the-magic-faraway-tree-review-2026" class="tileImageLink" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapDesktop_a9slj_100"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106387327/400/225/image.webp 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106387327/750/422/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106387327/1024/576/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106387327/1372/772/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106387327/1536/864/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106387327/1920/1080/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="422"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106387327/750/422/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106387327/400/225/image.jpg 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106387327/750/422/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106387327/1024/576/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106387327/1372/772/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106387327/1536/864/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106387327/1920/1080/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-16-9" title="The Magic Faraway Tree" alt="The Magic Faraway Tree" width="750" height="422" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapMobile_a9slj_205"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106387327/380/285/image.webp 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106387327/750/562/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106387327/1024/768/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106387327/1372/1029/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106387327/1536/1152/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106387327/1920/1440/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="562"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106387327/750/562/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106387327/380/285/image.jpg 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106387327/750/562/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106387327/1024/768/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106387327/1372/1029/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106387327/1536/1152/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106387327/1920/1440/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-4-3" title="The Magic Faraway Tree" alt="The Magic Faraway Tree" width="750" height="562" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><figcaption class="_figcaption_18vpl_1" data-testid="image-credits_testID"><span>Photograph: Entertainment Film Distributors</span></figcaption></a></div><div class="_summaryContainer_a9slj_361"><div class="_summary_a9slj_23"><div class="_p_1mmxl_1" data-testid="summary_testID"><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Weird things happen up the Magic Faraway Tree. Think, zany characters residing in its branches, a big slide and a long ladder leading to a revolving carousel of magical kingdoms. A sugary confection for a wartime generation deprived of goodies (and their parents) during the early 1940s, it&rsquo;s Enid Blyton at her most escapist.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Transplanting all the hippy-dippy goodness from a three-book series into a movie, it&rsquo;s a smart update of the Blyton stories for the smartphone era.</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><br /></span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><br /></span><em><span style="font-weight: 400;">The Magic Faraway Tree is&nbsp;i</span></em><em><span style="font-weight: 400;">n US theaters Friday, August 21.</span></em></p></div></div></div><div class="_ctaButtons_a9slj_109"><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _viewMoreCta_a9slj_130"><a class="_secondary_1gagn_22" href="/movies/the-magic-faraway-tree-review-2026" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;read more button&quot;}}" data-testid="view-more-cta_testID"><span class="_textContent_1gagn_69">Read review</span></a></div></div></div></article><article class="tile _article_a9slj_1" data-testid="tile-zone-large-list_testID"><div class="articleContent _articleContent_a9slj_226"><div class="_title_a9slj_11"><a href="/movies/i-want-your-sex-review-2026" class="" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><h3 class="_h3_c6c0h_1" data-testid="tile-title_testID"><span>26.</span>&nbsp;"I Want Your Sex"</h3></a></div><div class="_tileTags_a9slj_52"><section class="_tags_1i2cm_17" data-testid="tags_testID"><ul class="_tagsList_1i2cm_17"><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Movies</span></li><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Comedy</span></li><li class="_tagBare_1i2cm_27 _tagComponent_1i2cm_63"><div class="_ratingStars_1qrzr_1" data-testid="star-rating_testID"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBo