ut.com/images/106429663/750/562/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106429663/1024/768/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106429663/1372/1029/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106429663/1536/1152/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106429663/1920/1440/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="562"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106429663/750/562/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106429663/380/285/image.jpg 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106429663/750/562/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106429663/1024/768/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106429663/1372/1029/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106429663/1536/1152/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106429663/1920/1440/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-4-3" title="&quot;Spider-Man: Brand New Day&quot;" alt="&quot;Spider-Man: Brand New Day&quot;" width="750" height="562" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><figcaption class="_figcaption_18vpl_1" data-testid="image-credits_testID"><span>Photograph: Marvel</span></figcaption></a></div><div class="_summaryContainer_a9slj_361"><div class="_summary_a9slj_23"><div class="_p_1mmxl_1" data-testid="summary_testID"><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Catch Tom Holland and Zendaya in the newest chapter of their marvelous fictional&mdash;and real life&mdash;love story.&nbsp;</span><em>Spider-Man: Brand New Day</em> is Marvel's entry into this abundant season of cinema.&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The film entered theaters worldwide on July 31</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="_ctaButtons_a9slj_109"><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _viewMoreCta_a9slj_130"><a class="_secondary_1gagn_22" href="/movies/spider-man-brand-new-day-review-2026" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;read more button&quot;}}" data-testid="view-more-cta_testID"><span class="_textContent_1gagn_69">Read review</span></a></div></div></div></article><article class="tile _article_a9slj_1" data-testid="tile-zone-large-list_testID"><div class="articleContent _articleContent_a9slj_226"><div class="_title_a9slj_11"><a href="/newyork/news/experience-life-aboard-the-international-space-station-at-this-new-immersive-exhibit-070626" class="" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><h3 class="_h3_c6c0h_1" data-testid="tile-title_testID"><span>30.</span>&nbsp;Space Explorers: The ISS Experience</h3></a></div><div class="_tileTags_a9slj_52"><section class="_tags_1i2cm_17" data-testid="tags_testID"><ul class="_tagsList_1i2cm_17"><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Things to do</span></li><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Events &amp; Festivals</span></li></ul></section></div><div class="_imageContainer_a9slj_48"><a href="/newyork/news/experience-life-aboard-the-international-space-station-at-this-new-immersive-exhibit-070626" class="tileImageLink" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapDesktop_a9slj_100"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106423836/400/225/image.webp 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106423836/750/422/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106423836/1024/576/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106423836/1372/772/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106423836/1536/864/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106423836/1920/1080/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="422"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106423836/750/422/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106423836/400/225/image.jpg 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106423836/750/422/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106423836/1024/576/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106423836/1372/772/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106423836/1536/864/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106423836/1920/1080/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-16-9" title="Space Explorers: The ISS Experience" alt="Space Explorers: The ISS Experience" width="750" height="422" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapMobile_a9slj_205"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106423836/380/285/image.webp 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106423836/750/562/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106423836/1024/768/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106423836/1372/1029/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106423836/1536/1152/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106423836/1920/1440/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="562"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106423836/750/562/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106423836/380/285/image.jpg 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106423836/750/562/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106423836/1024/768/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106423836/1372/1029/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106423836/1536/1152/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106423836/1920/1440/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-4-3" title="Space Explorers: The ISS Experience" alt="Space Explorers: The ISS Experience" width="750" height="562" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><figcaption class="_figcaption_18vpl_1" data-testid="image-credits_testID"><span>Photograph: Courtesy Eclipso | Space Explorers: The ISS Experience</span></figcaption></a></div><div class="_summaryContainer_a9slj_361"><div class="_summary_a9slj_23"><div class="_p_1mmxl_1" data-testid="summary_testID"><p>Get ready to journey through the cosmos, right here in New York City. The&nbsp;<a href="https://www.timeout.com/newyork/news/a-new-vr-space-experience-based-on-real-life-missions-is-opening-in-nyc-060526">highly-anticipated</a>&nbsp;"Space Explorers: The ISS Experience" has officially opened at Eclipso New York at 55 West 57th Street for a strictly limited engagement. Based on the Primetime Emmy Award-winning immersive series by Felix &amp; Paul Studios, this groundbreaking exhibit gives you the rare chance to step into the boots of an astronaut and experience life aboard the International Space Station (ISS).</p>
<p>While fewer than 300 people have actually traveled to the ISS over the past two decades, this ambitious free-roaming virtual reality experience opens the hatches to everyone.</p>
<p>At the core of the exhibit is the largest cinematic production ever filmed in space. Utilizing cutting-edge 3D 360-degree VR technology, you'll be transported nearly 250 miles above Earth. You're free to roam the virtual environment, where you'll walk alongside real astronauts, witness thrilling spacewalks and listen to interviews about life in zero gravity.</p></div></div></div><div class="_ctaButtons_a9slj_109"><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _viewMoreCta_a9slj_130"><a class="_secondary_1gagn_22" href="/newyork/news/experience-life-aboard-the-international-space-station-at-this-new-immersive-exhibit-070626" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;read more button&quot;}}" data-testid="view-more-cta_testID"><span class="_textContent_1gagn_69">Read more</span></a></div></div></div></article><div class="_adsInline_1t43t_10"><div data-testid="inline-generated-ad_testID" class="_inlineAdWrapper_16tbe_72 containerAdWrapper"><div class="_inlineAdContainer_16tbe_67"><span class="caps xs-block xs-text-10 xs-mb2 xs-text-center _inlineAdHeader_16tbe_82">Advertising</span><div class="_inlineAd_16tbe_67"><div id="ad-list-15-5328" class="_ad_16tbe_1 containerAd _ad-list_16tbe_61 " data-testid="ad_testID"><script>
