                    </script></div></div></div></div></div><article class="tile _article_a9slj_1" data-testid="tile-zone-large-list_testID"><div class="articleContent _articleContent_a9slj_226"><div class="_title_a9slj_11"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/flower-power-at-nybg" class="" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><h3 class="_h3_c6c0h_1" data-testid="tile-title_testID"><span>31.</span>&nbsp;Flower Power at NYBG</h3></a></div><div class="_tileTags_a9slj_52"><section class="_tags_1i2cm_17" data-testid="tags_testID"><ul class="_tagsList_1i2cm_17"><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Things to do</span></li></ul></section></div><div class="_imageContainer_a9slj_48"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/flower-power-at-nybg" class="tileImageLink" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapDesktop_a9slj_100"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106403109/400/225/image.webp 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106403109/750/422/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106403109/1024/576/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106403109/1372/772/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106403109/1536/864/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106403109/1920/1080/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="422"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106403109/750/422/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106403109/400/225/image.jpg 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106403109/750/422/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106403109/1024/576/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106403109/1372/772/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106403109/1536/864/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106403109/1920/1080/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-16-9" title="Flower Power at NYBG" alt="Flower Power at NYBG" width="750" height="422" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapMobile_a9slj_205"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106403109/380/285/image.webp 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106403109/750/562/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106403109/1024/768/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106403109/1372/1029/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106403109/1536/1152/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106403109/1920/1440/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="562"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106403109/750/562/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106403109/380/285/image.jpg 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106403109/750/562/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106403109/1024/768/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106403109/1372/1029/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106403109/1536/1152/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106403109/1920/1440/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-4-3" title="Flower Power at NYBG" alt="Flower Power at NYBG" width="750" height="562" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><figcaption class="_figcaption_18vpl_1" data-testid="image-credits_testID"><span>Photograph: Courtesy New York Botanical Garden</span></figcaption></a></div><div class="_summaryContainer_a9slj_361"><div class="_summary_a9slj_23"><div class="_p_1mmxl_1" data-testid="summary_testID"><meta charset="utf-8" />
<p><span>Psychedelia comes to the New York Botanical Garden with&nbsp;</span><em>Flower Power</em><span>, a groovy, garden-wide takeover celebrating blooms as symbols of peace, love and counterculture cool. Running May 23 through October 18, the exhibition mixes vibrant botanical displays with &rsquo;60s-era art, plus trippy installations, live music and after-hours light shows. Wander through technicolor plantings, spot photo ops and lean into the feel-good nostalgia&mdash;it&rsquo;s part flower show, part time warp. And honestly, we could all use a little nature (and time travel) these days.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="_ctaButtons_a9slj_109"><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _viewMoreCta_a9slj_130"><a class="_secondary_1gagn_22" href="/newyork/things-to-do/flower-power-at-nybg" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;read more button&quot;}}" data-testid="view-more-cta_testID"><span class="_textContent_1gagn_69">Read more</span></a></div></div></div></article><article class="tile _article_a9slj_1" data-testid="tile-zone-large-list_testID"><div class="articleContent _articleContent_a9slj_226"><div class="_title_a9slj_11"><a href="/newyork/news/you-can-play-pickleball-in-central-park-again-starting-later-this-month-041326" class="" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><h3 class="_h3_c6c0h_1" data-testid="tile-title_testID"><span>32.</span>&nbsp;CityPickle in Central Park</h3></a></div><div class="_tileTags_a9slj_52"><section class="_tags_1i2cm_17" data-testid="tags_testID"><ul class="_tagsList_1i2cm_17"><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Sports and fitness</span></li><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Sports &amp; Fitness</span></li></ul></section></div><div class="_imageContainer_a9slj_48"><a href="/newyork/news/you-can-play-pickleball-in-central-park-again-starting-later-this-month-041326" class="tileImageLink" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapDesktop_a9slj_100"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106393819/400/225/image.webp 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106393819/750/422/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106393819/1024/576/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106393819/1372/772/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106393819/1536/864/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106393819/1920/1080/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="422"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106393819/750/422/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106393819/400/225/image.jpg 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106393819/750/422/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106393819/1024/576/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106393819/1372/772/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106393819/1536/864/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106393819/1920/1080/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-16-9" title="CityPickle in Central Park" alt="CityPickle in Central Park" width="750" height="422" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapMobile_a9slj_205"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106393819/380/285/image.webp 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106393819/750/562/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106393819/1024/768/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106393819/1372/1029/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106393819/1536/1152/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106393819/1920/1440/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="562"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106393819/750/562/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106393819/380/285/image.jpg 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106393819/750/562/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106393819/1024/768/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106393819/1372/1029/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106393819/1536/1152/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106393819/1920/1440/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-4-3" title="CityPickle in Central Park" alt="CityPickle in Central Park" width="750" height="562" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><figcaption class="_figcaption_18vpl_1" data-testid="image-credits_testID"><span>Photograph: Justin Steele</span></figcaption></a></div><div class="_summaryContainer_a9slj_361"><div class="_summary_a9slj_23"><div class="_p_1mmxl_1" data-testid="summary_testID"><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">After a long winter of wistfully eyeing empty courts, pickleball is officially making its return to<span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.timeout.com/newyork/parks/central-park">Central Park</a>.&nbsp;From&nbsp;</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">April 21, the iconic<span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.timeout.com/newyork/things-to-do/central-park-wollman-rink">Wollman Rink</a><span>&nbsp;once&nbsp;</span>again swaps skates for paddles as<span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.city-pickle.com/">CityPickle</a><span>&nbsp;</span>rolls back in for its fourth season, turning the space into a sprawling, 14-court pickleball hub right in the heart of the park.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The setup runs daily from 8 am to 9 pm through early fall, with programming that includes open play, clinics and private lessons for every level.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The courts can host hundreds of players each day and reservations open on a rolling basis one week in advance, meaning you&rsquo;ll need to plan ahead if you&rsquo;re hoping to snag a prime-time slot. One of the biggest draws remains the $5 community play sessions, which run for several hours each day and include complimentary paddle rentals, making it one of the more affordable ways to spend an afternoon in Central Park.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="_ctaButtons_a9slj_109"><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _viewMoreCta_a9slj_130"><a class="_secondary_1gagn_22" href="/newyork/news/you-can-play-pickleball-in-central-park-again-starting-later-this-month-041326" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;read more button&quot;}}" data-testid="view-more-cta_testID"><span class="_textContent_1gagn_69">Read more</span></a></div></div></div></article><div class="_adsInline_1t43t_10"><div data-testid="inline-generated-ad_testID" class="_inlineAdWrapper_16tbe_72 containerAdWrapper"><div class="_inlineAdContainer_16tbe_67"><span class="caps xs-block xs-text-10 xs-mb2 xs-text-center _inlineAdHeader_16tbe_82">Advertising</span><div class="_inlineAd_16tbe_67"><div id="ad-list-16-9898" class="_ad_16tbe_1 containerAd _ad-list_16tbe_61 " data-testid="ad_testID"><script>
