                    </script></div></div></div></div></div><article class="tile _article_a9slj_1" data-testid="tile-zone-large-list_testID"><div class="articleContent _articleContent_a9slj_226"><div class="_title_a9slj_11"><a href="/newyork/news/the-lombardi-trophy-and-more-iconic-sports-artifacts-are-coming-to-the-amnh-this-spring-021826" class="" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><h3 class="_h3_c6c0h_1" data-testid="tile-title_testID"><span>33.</span>&nbsp;"For The Win: Objects of Sports Excellence"</h3></a></div><div class="_tileTags_a9slj_52"><section class="_tags_1i2cm_17" data-testid="tags_testID"><ul class="_tagsList_1i2cm_17"><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Sports and fitness</span></li><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Sports &amp; Fitness</span></li></ul></section></div><div class="_imageContainer_a9slj_48"><a href="/newyork/news/the-lombardi-trophy-and-more-iconic-sports-artifacts-are-coming-to-the-amnh-this-spring-021826" class="tileImageLink" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapDesktop_a9slj_100"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106375012/400/225/image.webp 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106375012/750/422/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106375012/1024/576/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106375012/1372/772/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106375012/1536/864/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106375012/1920/1080/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="422"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106375012/750/422/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106375012/400/225/image.jpg 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106375012/750/422/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106375012/1024/576/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106375012/1372/772/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106375012/1536/864/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106375012/1920/1080/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-16-9" title="&quot;For The Win: Objects of Sports Excellence&quot;" alt="&quot;For The Win: Objects of Sports Excellence&quot;" width="750" height="422" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapMobile_a9slj_205"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106375012/380/285/image.webp 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106375012/750/562/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106375012/1024/768/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106375012/1372/1029/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106375012/1536/1152/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106375012/1920/1440/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="562"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106375012/750/562/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106375012/380/285/image.jpg 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106375012/750/562/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106375012/1024/768/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106375012/1372/1029/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106375012/1536/1152/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106375012/1920/1440/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-4-3" title="&quot;For The Win: Objects of Sports Excellence&quot;" alt="&quot;For The Win: Objects of Sports Excellence&quot;" width="750" height="562" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><figcaption class="_figcaption_18vpl_1" data-testid="image-credits_testID"><span>Photograph: AP Images</span></figcaption></a></div><div class="_summaryContainer_a9slj_361"><div class="_summary_a9slj_23"><div class="_p_1mmxl_1" data-testid="summary_testID"><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">New York&rsquo;s <a href="https://www.timeout.com/newyork/museums/american-museum-of-natural-history">American Museum of Natural History</a> is getting a serious dose of championship energy this spring.</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">&nbsp;&ldquo;<a href="https://www.amnh.org/exhibitions/for-the-win" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">For The Win: Objects of Sports Excellence</a>&rdquo; brings more than 70 glittering symbols of athletic glory&mdash;from Olympic medals to Super Bowl hardware&mdash;into the museum&rsquo;s Melissa and Keith Meister Gallery, set inside the Allison and Roberto Mignone Halls of Gems and Minerals.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Among other items, that means the Vince Lombardi Trophy itself will be on view. The sterling silver prize, which has been handcrafted by Tiffany &amp; Co. since 1967 and awarded annually to the Super Bowl champions, anchors an exhibition that spans more than 15 sports and nearly 150 years of competition. The show aims to trace how trophies, rings and medals evolved alongside modern sports culture.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="_ctaButtons_a9slj_109"><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _viewMoreCta_a9slj_130"><a class="_secondary_1gagn_22" href="/newyork/news/the-lombardi-trophy-and-more-iconic-sports-artifacts-are-coming-to-the-amnh-this-spring-021826" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;read more button&quot;}}" data-testid="view-more-cta_testID"><span class="_textContent_1gagn_69">Read more</span></a></div></div></div></article><article class="tile _article_a9slj_1" data-testid="tile-zone-large-list_testID"><div class="articleContent _articleContent_a9slj_226"><div class="_title_a9slj_11"><a href="/newyork/news/brooklyn-museums-hottest-new-haute-couture-exhibit-will-spotlight-iris-van-herpen-012826" class="" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><h3 class="_h3_c6c0h_1" data-testid="tile-title_testID"><span>34.</span>&nbsp;"Iris van Herpen: Sculpting the Senses" at the Brooklyn Museum</h3></a></div><div class="_tileTags_a9slj_52"><section class="_tags_1i2cm_17" data-testid="tags_testID"><ul class="_tagsList_1i2cm_17"><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Art</span></li></ul></section></div><div class="_imageContainer_a9slj_48"><a href="/newyork/news/brooklyn-museums-hottest-new-haute-couture-exhibit-will-spotlight-iris-van-herpen-012826" class="tileImageLink" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapDesktop_a9slj_100"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106366219/400/225/image.webp 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106366219/750/422/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106366219/1024/576/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106366219/1372/772/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106366219/1536/864/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106366219/1920/1080/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="422"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106366219/750/422/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106366219/400/225/image.jpg 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106366219/750/422/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106366219/1024/576/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106366219/1372/772/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106366219/1536/864/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106366219/1920/1080/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-16-9" title="&quot;Iris van Herpen: Sculpting the Senses&quot; at the Brooklyn Museum" alt="&quot;Iris van Herpen: Sculpting the Senses&quot; at the Brooklyn Museum" width="750" height="422" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapMobile_a9slj_205"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106366219/380/285/image.webp 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106366219/750/562/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106366219/1024/768/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106366219/1372/1029/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106366219/1536/1152/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106366219/1920/1440/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="562"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106366219/750/562/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106366219/380/285/image.jpg 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106366219/750/562/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106366219/1024/768/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106366219/1372/1029/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106366219/1536/1152/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106366219/1920/1440/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-4-3" title="&quot;Iris van Herpen: Sculpting the Senses&quot; at the Brooklyn Museum" alt="&quot;Iris van Herpen: Sculpting the Senses&quot; at the Brooklyn Museum" width="750" height="562" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><figcaption class="_figcaption_18vpl_1" data-testid="image-credits_testID"><span>Photograph: Courtesy Iris van Herpen</span></figcaption></a></div><div class="_summaryContainer_a9slj_361"><div class="_summary_a9slj_23"><div class="_p_1mmxl_1" data-testid="summary_testID"><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">If you&rsquo;ve ever wondered what haute couture might look like at the bottom of the ocean, inside a mushroom spore or on a distant alien planet, the<span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.timeout.com/newyork/museums/brooklyn-museum">Brooklyn Museum</a><span>&nbsp;</span>has an answer&mdash;and it involves bioluminescent algae, laser-cut dresses and a whole lot of 3D printing.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><span>Through December 6,&nbsp;</span></span><a href="https://www.brooklynmuseum.org/exhibitions/iris-van-herpen"><span style="font-weight: 400;">&ldquo;Iris van Herpen: Sculpting the Senses&rdquo;</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;"><span>&nbsp;</span>marks the North American debut of the Dutch designer&rsquo;s sprawling retrospective, bringing more than 140 of her couture creations to Brooklyn along with contemporary art, scientific specimens, fossils, sound installations and immersive video works.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="_ctaButtons_a9slj_109"><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _viewMoreCta_a9slj_130"><a class="_secondary_1gagn_22" href="/newyork/news/brooklyn-museums-hottest-new-haute-couture-exhibit-will-spotlight-iris-van-herpen-012826" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;read more button&quot;}}" data-testid="view-more-cta_testID"><span class="_textContent_1gagn_69">Read more</span></a></div></div></div></article><div class="_adsInline_1t43t_10"><div data-testid="inline-generated-ad_testID" class="_inlineAdWrapper_16tbe_72 containerAdWrapper"><div class="_inlineAdContainer_16tbe_67"><span class="caps xs-block xs-text-10 xs-mb2 xs-text-center _inlineAdHeader_16tbe_82">Advertising</span><div class="_inlineAd_16tbe_67"><div id="ad-list-17-9367" class="_ad_16tbe_1 containerAd _ad-list_16tbe_61 " data-testid="ad_testID"><script>
