                    </script></div></div></div></div></div><article class="tile _article_a9slj_1" data-testid="tile-zone-large-list_testID"><div class="articleContent _articleContent_a9slj_226"><div class="_title_a9slj_11"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/museum-of-sex-presents-the-life-force" class="" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><h3 class="_h3_c6c0h_1" data-testid="tile-title_testID"><span>35.</span>&nbsp;Museum of Sex Presents "The Life Force"</h3></a></div><div class="_tileTags_a9slj_52"><section class="_tags_1i2cm_17" data-testid="tags_testID"><ul class="_tagsList_1i2cm_17"><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Things to do</span></li></ul></section></div><div class="_imageContainer_a9slj_48"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/museum-of-sex-presents-the-life-force" class="tileImageLink" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapDesktop_a9slj_100"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106398567/400/225/image.webp 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106398567/750/422/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106398567/1024/576/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106398567/1372/772/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106398567/1536/864/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106398567/1920/1080/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="422"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106398567/750/422/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106398567/400/225/image.jpg 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106398567/750/422/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106398567/1024/576/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106398567/1372/772/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106398567/1536/864/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106398567/1920/1080/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-16-9" title="Museum of Sex Presents &quot;The Life Force&quot;" alt="Museum of Sex Presents &quot;The Life Force&quot;" width="750" height="422" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapMobile_a9slj_205"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106398567/380/285/image.webp 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106398567/750/562/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106398567/1024/768/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106398567/1372/1029/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106398567/1536/1152/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106398567/1920/1440/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="562"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106398567/750/562/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106398567/380/285/image.jpg 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106398567/750/562/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106398567/1024/768/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106398567/1372/1029/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106398567/1536/1152/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106398567/1920/1440/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-4-3" title="Museum of Sex Presents &quot;The Life Force&quot;" alt="Museum of Sex Presents &quot;The Life Force&quot;" width="750" height="562" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><figcaption class="_figcaption_18vpl_1" data-testid="image-credits_testID"><span>Photograph: Courtesy The Museum of Sex</span></figcaption></a></div><div class="_summaryContainer_a9slj_361"><div class="_summary_a9slj_23"><div class="_p_1mmxl_1" data-testid="summary_testID"><meta charset="utf-8" />
<p><span>Sex and mortality share the spotlight (as usual) at&nbsp;Manhattan's Museum of Sex with&nbsp;</span><em>The Life Force: Portraits</em><span>&nbsp;</span><em>from the Amparo &amp; Manuel Foundation</em><span>, running through November 30. The Mexico City&ndash;based Amparo &amp; Manuel Foundation makes its U.S. debut with 45 works spanning painting, sculpture and photography, exploring desire, vulnerability and resilience. Expect big names (pieces by&nbsp;</span><span class="s2">Tracey Emin,&nbsp;</span><span class="s2">Lisa Yuskavage,&nbsp;</span><span class="s2">Hernan Bas,&nbsp;</span><span class="s2">Oh de Laval and&nbsp;</span><span class="s2">Sarah Lucas will be on view, among others) as well as</span><span>&nbsp;intimate moments and bodies under pressure in a show that insists intimacy is its own form of resistance.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="_ctaButtons_a9slj_109"><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _viewMoreCta_a9slj_130"><a class="_secondary_1gagn_22" href="/newyork/things-to-do/museum-of-sex-presents-the-life-force" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;read more button&quot;}}" data-testid="view-more-cta_testID"><span class="_textContent_1gagn_69">Read more</span></a></div><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _bookingCta_a9slj_131"><a class="_a_1fa6w_1" href="https://nytix.museumofsex.com/p/home1" data-testid="buy-now-button_testID" target="_blank" rel="nofollow" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;label&quot;:&quot;ev booking&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;affiliate_partner&quot;:&quot;other&quot;,&quot;affiliate_link_type&quot;:&quot;button&quot;,&quot;affiliate_link_location&quot;:&quot;list&quot;,&quot;affiliate_superlist_position&quot;:35}}">Buy ticket</a></div></div></div></article><article class="tile _article_a9slj_1" data-testid="tile-zone-large-list_testID"><div class="articleContent _articleContent_a9slj_226"><div class="_title_a9slj_11"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/before-new-york-a-traveling-pop-up-exhibition" class="" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><h3 class="_h3_c6c0h_1" data-testid="tile-title_testID"><span>36.</span>&nbsp;Before New York: A Traveling Pop-Up Exhibition</h3></a></div><div class="_tileTags_a9slj_52"><section class="_tags_1i2cm_17" data-testid="tags_testID"><ul class="_tagsList_1i2cm_17"><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Things to do</span></li></ul></section></div><div class="_imageContainer_a9slj_48"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/before-new-york-a-traveling-pop-up-exhibition" class="tileImageLink" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapDesktop_a9slj_100"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/105683579/400/225/image.webp 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105683579/750/422/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105683579/1024/576/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105683579/1372/772/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105683579/1536/864/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105683579/1920/1080/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="422"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/105683579/750/422/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/105683579/400/225/image.jpg 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105683579/750/422/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105683579/1024/576/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105683579/1372/772/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105683579/1536/864/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105683579/1920/1080/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-16-9" title="Before New York: A Traveling Pop-Up Exhibition" alt="Before New York: A Traveling Pop-Up Exhibition" width="750" height="422" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapMobile_a9slj_205"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/105683579/380/285/image.webp 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105683579/750/562/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105683579/1024/768/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105683579/1372/1029/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105683579/1536/1152/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105683579/1920/1440/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="562"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/105683579/750/562/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/105683579/380/285/image.jpg 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105683579/750/562/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105683579/1024/768/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105683579/1372/1029/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105683579/1536/1152/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/105683579/1920/1440/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-4-3" title="Before New York: A Traveling Pop-Up Exhibition" alt="Before New York: A Traveling Pop-Up Exhibition" width="750" height="562" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><figcaption class="_figcaption_18vpl_1" data-testid="image-credits_testID"><span>Photograph: Shutterstock</span></figcaption></a></div><div class="_summaryContainer_a9slj_361"><div class="_summary_a9slj_23"><div class="_p_1mmxl_1" data-testid="summary_testID"><meta charset="utf-8" />
<p><span>Step back in time at&nbsp;</span><em>Before New York: A Traveling Pop-Up Exhibition</em><span>&nbsp;at the New York Botanical Garden, where the city&rsquo;s&nbsp;original landscape becomes the focus. This immersive display from&nbsp;</span><span>ecologist Dr. Eric W. Sanderson and colleagues&nbsp;reconstructs&nbsp;the&nbsp;area&nbsp;as it&nbsp;was on September 12, 1609,&nbsp;just before Henry Hudson landed.</span><span>&nbsp;</span><em>Before New York</em><span>&nbsp;explores the region&rsquo;s original ecosystems and Indigenous histories, inviting visitors to imagine Manhattan as it once was: lush, wild and teeming with life. It&rsquo;s a fascinating, thought-provoking complement to the Garden&rsquo;s living collections and environmental mission.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="_ctaButtons_a9slj_109"><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _viewMoreCta_a9slj_130"><a class="_secondary_1gagn_22" href="/newyork/things-to-do/before-new-york-a-traveling-pop-up-exhibition" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;read more button&quot;}}" data-testid="view-more-cta_testID"><span class="_textContent_1gagn_69">Read more</span></a></div></div></div></article><div class="_adsInline_1t43t_10"><div data-testid="inline-generated-ad_testID" class="_inlineAdWrapper_16tbe_72 containerAdWrapper"><div class="_inlineAdContainer_16tbe_67"><span class="caps xs-block xs-text-10 xs-mb2 xs-text-center _inlineAdHeader_16tbe_82">Advertising</span><div class="_inlineAd_16tbe_67"><div id="ad-list-18-2478" class="_ad_16tbe_1 containerAd _ad-list_16tbe_61 " data-testid="ad_testID"><script>
