                    </script></div></div></div></div></div><article class="tile _article_a9slj_1" data-testid="tile-zone-large-list_testID"><div class="articleContent _articleContent_a9slj_226"><div class="_title_a9slj_11"><a href="/newyork/news/rooftop-cinema-club-all-the-movies-you-can-catch-on-a-rooftop-next-month-033026" class="" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><h3 class="_h3_c6c0h_1" data-testid="tile-title_testID"><span>37.</span>&nbsp;Rooftop Cinema Club</h3></a></div><div class="_tileTags_a9slj_52"><section class="_tags_1i2cm_17" data-testid="tags_testID"><ul class="_tagsList_1i2cm_17"><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Movies</span></li></ul></section></div><div class="_imageContainer_a9slj_48"><a href="/newyork/news/rooftop-cinema-club-all-the-movies-you-can-catch-on-a-rooftop-next-month-033026" class="tileImageLink" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapDesktop_a9slj_100"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106389087/400/225/image.webp 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106389087/750/422/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106389087/1024/576/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106389087/1372/772/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106389087/1536/864/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106389087/1920/1080/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="422"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106389087/750/422/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106389087/400/225/image.jpg 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106389087/750/422/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106389087/1024/576/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106389087/1372/772/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106389087/1536/864/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106389087/1920/1080/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-16-9" title="Rooftop Cinema Club" alt="Rooftop Cinema Club" width="750" height="422" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapMobile_a9slj_205"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106389087/380/285/image.webp 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106389087/750/562/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106389087/1024/768/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106389087/1372/1029/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106389087/1536/1152/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106389087/1920/1440/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="562"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106389087/750/562/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106389087/380/285/image.jpg 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106389087/750/562/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106389087/1024/768/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106389087/1372/1029/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106389087/1536/1152/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106389087/1920/1440/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-4-3" title="Rooftop Cinema Club" alt="Rooftop Cinema Club" width="750" height="562" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><figcaption class="_figcaption_18vpl_1" data-testid="image-credits_testID"><span>Photograph: Courtesy of Rooftop Cinema Club</span></figcaption></a></div><div class="_summaryContainer_a9slj_361"><div class="_summary_a9slj_23"><div class="_p_1mmxl_1" data-testid="summary_testID"><p><a href="https://rooftopcinemaclub.com/new-york/venue/midtown/"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Rooftop Cinema Club</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;"> has returned to midtown with a lineup focused on crowd-pleasers and date-night classics with just enough nostalgia. The concept is simple but effective: open-air (well, technically enclosed and heated for spring), skyline views, wireless headphones and a rotating schedule of films.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="_ctaButtons_a9slj_109"><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _viewMoreCta_a9slj_130"><a class="_secondary_1gagn_22" href="/newyork/news/rooftop-cinema-club-all-the-movies-you-can-catch-on-a-rooftop-next-month-033026" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;read more button&quot;}}" data-testid="view-more-cta_testID"><span class="_textContent_1gagn_69">Read more</span></a></div></div></div></article><article class="tile _article_a9slj_1" data-testid="tile-zone-large-list_testID"><div class="articleContent _articleContent_a9slj_226"><div class="_title_a9slj_11"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/unleashed-pets-of-the-performing-arts" class="" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><h3 class="_h3_c6c0h_1" data-testid="tile-title_testID"><span>38.</span>&nbsp;Unleashed: Pets of the Performing Arts</h3></a></div><div class="_tileTags_a9slj_52"><section class="_tags_1i2cm_17" data-testid="tags_testID"><ul class="_tagsList_1i2cm_17"><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Things to do</span></li><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Exhibitions</span></li></ul></section></div><div class="_imageContainer_a9slj_48"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/unleashed-pets-of-the-performing-arts" class="tileImageLink" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapDesktop_a9slj_100"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106436936/400/225/image.webp 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436936/750/422/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436936/1024/576/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436936/1372/772/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436936/1536/864/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436936/1920/1080/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="422"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106436936/750/422/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106436936/400/225/image.jpg 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436936/750/422/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436936/1024/576/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436936/1372/772/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436936/1536/864/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436936/1920/1080/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-16-9" title="Unleashed: Pets of the Performing Arts" alt="Unleashed: Pets of the Performing Arts" width="750" height="422" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapMobile_a9slj_205"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106436936/380/285/image.webp 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436936/750/562/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436936/1024/768/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436936/1372/1029/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436936/1536/1152/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436936/1920/1440/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="562"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106436936/750/562/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106436936/380/285/image.jpg 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436936/750/562/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436936/1024/768/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436936/1372/1029/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436936/1536/1152/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106436936/1920/1440/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-4-3" title="Unleashed: Pets of the Performing Arts" alt="Unleashed: Pets of the Performing Arts" width="750" height="562" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><figcaption class="_figcaption_18vpl_1" data-testid="image-credits_testID"><span>Photograph: William P. Gottlieb. Music and Recorded Sound Division, The New York Public Library for the Performing Arts.</span></figcaption></a></div><div class="_summaryContainer_a9slj_361"><div class="_summary_a9slj_23"><div class="_p_1mmxl_1" data-testid="summary_testID"><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta charset="utf-8" />
<p><span>Celebrity pets have been a thing long before Paris Hilton&nbsp;put her tiny dog in her purse. A new exhibit at the New York Public Library for the Performing Arts puts the animals in the spotlight they always deserved, now through February 23, 2027.&nbsp;</span><em>Unleashed: Pets&nbsp;of the Performing Arts</em><span>&nbsp;celebrates the&nbsp;beloved pets who have shaped and inspired some of the greatest performing artists of all time, from Baryshnikov to Billie Holiday.&nbsp;It&rsquo;s a delightful reminder that&nbsp;even the most inspired genius probably had lengthy, one-sided conversations with a silent pet about when she'd come home.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="_ctaButtons_a9slj_109"><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _viewMoreCta_a9slj_130"><a class="_secondary_1gagn_22" href="/newyork/things-to-do/unleashed-pets-of-the-performing-arts" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;read more button&quot;}}" data-testid="view-more-cta_testID"><span class="_textContent_1gagn_69">Read more</span></a></div></div></div></article><div class="_adsInline_1t43t_10"><div data-testid="inline-generated-ad_testID" class="_inlineAdWrapper_16tbe_72 containerAdWrapper"><div class="_inlineAdContainer_16tbe_67"><span class="caps xs-block xs-text-10 xs-mb2 xs-text-center _inlineAdHeader_16tbe_82">Advertising</span><div class="_inlineAd_16tbe_67"><div id="ad-list-19-5609" class="_ad_16tbe_1 containerAd _ad-list_16tbe_61 " data-testid="ad_testID"><script>
