                    </script></div></div></div></div></div><article class="tile _article_a9slj_1" data-testid="tile-zone-large-list_testID"><div class="articleContent _articleContent_a9slj_226"><div class="_title_a9slj_11"><a href="/newyork/news/first-look-the-studio-museum-in-harlem-is-set-to-reopen-its-home-for-black-art-after-a-seven-year-closure-110625" class="" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><h3 class="_h3_c6c0h_1" data-testid="tile-title_testID"><span>41.</span>&nbsp;The Studio Museum in Harlem</h3></a></div><div class="_tileTags_a9slj_52"><section class="_tags_1i2cm_17" data-testid="tags_testID"><ul class="_tagsList_1i2cm_17"><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Art</span></li></ul></section></div><div class="_imageContainer_a9slj_48"><a href="/newyork/news/first-look-the-studio-museum-in-harlem-is-set-to-reopen-its-home-for-black-art-after-a-seven-year-closure-110625" class="tileImageLink" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapDesktop_a9slj_100"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106339987/400/225/image.webp 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106339987/750/422/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106339987/1024/576/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106339987/1372/772/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106339987/1536/864/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106339987/1920/1080/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="422"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106339987/750/422/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106339987/400/225/image.jpg 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106339987/750/422/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106339987/1024/576/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106339987/1372/772/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106339987/1536/864/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106339987/1920/1080/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-16-9" title="The Studio Museum in Harlem" alt="The Studio Museum in Harlem" width="750" height="422" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapMobile_a9slj_205"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106339987/380/285/image.webp 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106339987/750/562/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106339987/1024/768/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106339987/1372/1029/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106339987/1536/1152/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106339987/1920/1440/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="562"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106339987/750/562/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106339987/380/285/image.jpg 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106339987/750/562/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106339987/1024/768/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106339987/1372/1029/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106339987/1536/1152/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106339987/1920/1440/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-4-3" title="The Studio Museum in Harlem" alt="The Studio Museum in Harlem" width="750" height="562" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><figcaption class="_figcaption_18vpl_1" data-testid="image-credits_testID"><span>Photograph: By Albert Vecerka/Esto</span></figcaption></a></div><div class="_summaryContainer_a9slj_361"><div class="_summary_a9slj_23"><div class="_p_1mmxl_1" data-testid="summary_testID"><meta charset="utf-8" />
<p>When Studio Museum opened in 1968, it was the first Black fine arts museum in the country, and it remains the place to go for historical insight into African American art and the art of the African diaspora. The museum reopened in 2025 after a seven-year closure for construction. The new space, located on the same footprint along 125th Street, doubled space for the groundbreaking exhibitions the museum is known for.&nbsp;</p>
<p>The abstract, towering building is centered around a sleek&nbsp;stone staircase, which stretches throughout the building like a spine. At the bottom, there's a community hangout area called the stoop. At the top, a lush garden with skyline views will no doubt become a popular space in warmer weather. Throughout, exhibitions fill each floor, drawing pieces from the museum's collection of 9,000 pieces and highlighting works by artists-in-residence over the years.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></div></div></div><div class="_ctaButtons_a9slj_109"><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _viewMoreCta_a9slj_130"><a class="_secondary_1gagn_22" href="/newyork/news/first-look-the-studio-museum-in-harlem-is-set-to-reopen-its-home-for-black-art-after-a-seven-year-closure-110625" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;read more button&quot;}}" data-testid="view-more-cta_testID"><span class="_textContent_1gagn_69">Read more</span></a></div></div></div></article><article class="tile _article_a9slj_1" data-testid="tile-zone-large-list_testID"><div class="articleContent _articleContent_a9slj_226"><div class="_title_a9slj_11"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/grand-bazaar-nyc" class="" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><h3 class="_h3_c6c0h_1" data-testid="tile-title_testID"><span>42.</span>&nbsp;Grand Bazaar NYC</h3></a></div><div class="_tileTags_a9slj_52"><section class="_tags_1i2cm_17" data-testid="tags_testID"><ul class="_tagsList_1i2cm_17"><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Things to do</span></li><li class="_tag_1i2cm_17"><span class="_text_1i2cm_68">Markets and fairs</span></li></ul></section></div><div class="_imageContainer_a9slj_48"><a href="/newyork/things-to-do/grand-bazaar-nyc" class="tileImageLink" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;in content&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;}}" data-testid="tile-link_testID"><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapDesktop_a9slj_100"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106338499/400/225/image.webp 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106338499/750/422/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106338499/1024/576/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106338499/1372/772/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106338499/1536/864/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106338499/1920/1080/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="422"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106338499/750/422/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106338499/400/225/image.jpg 400w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106338499/750/422/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106338499/1024/576/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106338499/1372/772/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106338499/1536/864/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106338499/1920/1080/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-16-9" title="Grand Bazaar NYC" alt="Grand Bazaar NYC" width="750" height="422" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="_imageWrap_a9slj_96 _imageWrapMobile_a9slj_205"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106338499/380/285/image.webp 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106338499/750/562/image.webp 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106338499/1024/768/image.webp 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106338499/1372/1029/image.webp 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106338499/1536/1152/image.webp 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106338499/1920/1440/image.webp 1920w" width="750" height="562"/><img src="https://media.timeout.com/images/106338499/750/562/image.jpg" srcSet="https://media.timeout.com/images/106338499/380/285/image.jpg 380w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106338499/750/562/image.jpg 750w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106338499/1024/768/image.jpg 1024w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106338499/1372/1029/image.jpg 1372w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106338499/1536/1152/image.jpg 1536w,https://media.timeout.com/images/106338499/1920/1440/image.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto" class="_image_a9slj_48 aspect-ratio-4-3" title="Grand Bazaar NYC" alt="Grand Bazaar NYC" width="750" height="562" data-testid="responsive-image_testID" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><figcaption class="_figcaption_18vpl_1" data-testid="image-credits_testID"><span>Photograph: Courtesy of Grand Bazaar</span></figcaption></a></div><div class="_summaryContainer_a9slj_361"><div class="_summary_a9slj_23"><div class="_p_1mmxl_1" data-testid="summary_testID"><meta charset="utf-8" />
<p class="p1"><span>G</span><span>rand Bazaar is one of NYC's oldest and largest marketplaces where you can buy vintage treasures, antiques, clothing and more goodies from more than 150 local merchants. Photographers, jewelers and furniture designers&nbsp;sell their best on Sundays between 10am and 5pm on the Upper West Side (77th Street at Columbus Avenue), rain or shine.</span></p>
<p class="p1"><span>Each week offers a different theme, from featuring women-owned businesses to focusing on handmade items to spotlighting international wares. The market runs both indoors and outdoors each week all year long.</span></p>
<p class="p1"><span>As a testament to the beloved Grand Bazaar's staying power, the market is celebrating 40 years in 2025.&nbsp;</span>Grand Bazaar also has a mission to give back with 100% of its profits from booth rentals supporting four local public schools, helping&nbsp;with everything from school supplies through teaching assistants.</p></div></div></div><div class="_ctaButtons_a9slj_109"><div class="_cta_a9slj_109 _viewMoreCta_a9slj_130"><a class="_secondary_1gagn_22" href="/newyork/things-to-do/grand-bazaar-nyc" target="_self" rel="" data-data-layer="{&quot;triggerOn&quot;:0,&quot;payload&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;link - internal&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;GP Engagement&quot;,&quot;labe